WEBVTT

01:45.750 --> 01:47.833
The next song request is…

01:48.000 --> 01:51.375
"Chellame Magale" from the movie
Meendum Sorgam.

01:51.625 --> 01:53.083
The listeners who have requested it are

01:53.250 --> 01:56.250
Ranganayagi, Muthu, Mani from Arulambadi,

01:56.333 --> 01:58.625
and Malarmaran from Mannargudi.

01:58.708 --> 02:00.958
Darling one! My daughter!

02:01.208 --> 02:03.416
As pure as sandalwood

02:03.666 --> 02:08.041
Mine, my life, Thenmozhi!

02:08.666 --> 02:10.833
The King's daughter

02:11.250 --> 02:13.375
The magic vessel

02:13.750 --> 02:16.250
The auspicious lamp

02:16.333 --> 02:18.166
Listen, my dear…

02:18.750 --> 02:21.250
The Mother's face…

02:21.333 --> 02:23.625
And God's nature…

02:23.708 --> 02:25.708
You possess…

02:25.791 --> 02:28.583
My… Gorgeous flower!

02:28.708 --> 02:31.250
You lay in the cradle…

02:31.333 --> 02:33.750
You grew up on the Shoulders

02:33.833 --> 02:38.750
You blossomed into a woman, my lovely!

02:38.833 --> 02:43.708
You blossomed into a woman my lovely!

02:43.833 --> 02:45.833
Darling one! My daughter!

02:46.125 --> 02:48.291
As pure as sandalwood

02:48.583 --> 02:51.291
Mine, my life…

02:51.375 --> 02:53.375
Thenmozhi!

02:53.666 --> 02:56.000
The King's daughter!

02:56.291 --> 02:58.500
The magic vessel

02:58.625 --> 03:01.250
The auspicious lamp

03:01.333 --> 03:03.291
Listen, my dear…

03:33.541 --> 03:34.500
It's nice, isn't it?

03:37.541 --> 03:38.416
The balloon is flying.

03:38.583 --> 03:39.458
I'll just take a look and come.

03:42.291 --> 03:43.166
Here, hold it.

03:47.791 --> 03:48.666
Dad.

03:48.833 --> 03:49.750
What?

03:49.958 --> 03:51.625
Can you buy me this?

03:52.041 --> 03:52.916
Show me.

03:54.708 --> 03:55.583
Why do you need this?

03:57.166 --> 03:58.250
I will play with it.

03:58.958 --> 03:59.833
What is the price of this?

04:00.000 --> 04:00.875
Four rupees.

04:01.000 --> 04:02.333
-Gosh!
-Don't waste money.

04:02.416 --> 04:04.000
-Keep it back.
-Okay, give three rupees.

04:04.458 --> 04:05.416
I will give you 50 paise.

04:05.875 --> 04:06.750
What?

04:06.833 --> 04:07.708
You can leave now.

04:07.791 --> 04:08.666
Please put it back and go.

04:08.958 --> 04:09.833
Leave it.

04:11.083 --> 04:11.958
Okay, leave it and come.

04:23.291 --> 04:24.458
Take it.

04:25.333 --> 04:26.208
For you?

04:26.416 --> 04:27.291
I don't want.

04:27.416 --> 04:28.291
Take this.

04:28.875 --> 04:30.541
Hey, I'm giving it to you.

04:45.375 --> 04:46.500
Put that away and go to sleep.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.083
You have school tomorrow.

06:35.875 --> 06:36.750
Hey…

06:36.833 --> 06:37.708
Baththa!

06:37.791 --> 06:39.041
No Baththa!
Don't do this Baththa!

06:39.166 --> 06:41.083
No Baththa!
Don't do this Baththa!

06:41.166 --> 06:42.500
No Baththa!
Don't do this Baththa!

06:42.916 --> 06:44.666
Leave him Baththa!

06:45.000 --> 06:46.458
Please don't do this!

06:46.708 --> 06:47.625
Oh my!

06:48.041 --> 06:49.041
Oh my!

06:50.166 --> 06:51.916
Someone save him.

06:52.375 --> 06:53.750
Oh my!

06:53.833 --> 06:55.500
Baththa, please don't!

06:55.583 --> 06:56.833
Please don't do this!

06:57.666 --> 06:59.666
Someone save him.

07:00.375 --> 07:02.833
Lord 'Kaathavarayan'
is ready for the hunt!

07:02.916 --> 07:05.125
The Goddess is on a hunger hunt!

07:05.250 --> 07:07.625
The enemy has no chance against him!

07:07.708 --> 07:09.875
This is Baththa's 'Baththavatharam'!

07:10.000 --> 07:12.458
Someone save him.

07:13.125 --> 07:14.208
No Baththa!

07:15.958 --> 07:17.666
No Baththa!
Stop this Baththa!

07:23.750 --> 07:24.625
Oh my!

07:24.708 --> 07:26.125
Let this fear be there!

07:41.208 --> 07:43.583
Lord 'Kaathavarayan'
is ready for the hunt!

07:43.666 --> 07:46.000
The Goddess is on a hunger hunt!

07:46.083 --> 07:48.375
The enemy has no chance against him!

07:48.458 --> 07:50.583
This is Baththa's 'Baththavatharam'!

07:50.666 --> 07:52.583
GOVERNMENT HIGHER SECONDARY SCHOOL

07:58.083 --> 07:59.125
Hey Sabari!

08:00.000 --> 08:01.333
Why you looking dull?

08:01.791 --> 08:07.791
Baththa beat the hell out
of my neighbor Jyoti!

08:08.125 --> 08:10.666
Jyoti's body was covered in blood!

08:11.041 --> 08:14.916
Baththa broke Jyoti's hand!

08:15.000 --> 08:18.458
Jyoti would have triggered
Baththa, that's why.

08:19.500 --> 08:21.041
One person I knew,

08:21.166 --> 08:23.291
was casually sitting in his house,

08:23.458 --> 08:25.833
and asked 'As if Baththa
is such a big shot?'

08:25.958 --> 08:28.500
No idea how that reached Baththa's ears.

08:28.666 --> 08:30.333
That very evening he came.

08:30.500 --> 08:34.208
Smashed his ribs and stuffed him under his
armpit and left!

08:34.375 --> 08:36.541
Hey! Even in my street,
one man,

08:36.625 --> 08:39.958
when Baththa was passing by, he was just
singing a song,

08:40.375 --> 08:42.541
don't know what Baththa thought,

08:42.708 --> 08:44.458
he got down from his bike,

08:44.583 --> 08:48.250
came and thrashed him and dumped
him in the trash can.

08:48.416 --> 08:49.833
When Baththa is around,
no one will even sing.

08:50.083 --> 08:52.208
When Baththa is around no
one will even sing.

08:53.333 --> 08:55.666
In his terrace he has a cage,

08:55.833 --> 08:57.375
where he keeps a lion!

08:57.583 --> 08:58.583
Really?

08:58.750 --> 09:02.000
Yes. One day my dad and me were returning
after seeing,

09:02.208 --> 09:04.083
the night show at Natraj theater.

09:04.333 --> 09:07.750
I saw him and his lion pissing
on the Electric transformer!

09:09.208 --> 09:11.833
Is that why there are frequent power cuts?

09:12.291 --> 09:14.500
No one can do anything to him.

09:14.875 --> 09:17.958
Once the police caught him
and put him in jail,

09:18.583 --> 09:22.500
he broke all the jail bars,
flung it and came out.

09:23.875 --> 09:28.583
Everyone is petrified of him,
but he is not scared of anything.

09:35.666 --> 09:38.541
After the thrashing you gave, the
entire area is scared out of their wits.

09:40.208 --> 09:44.916
If he wants to put another shop near ours,
what guts he must have!

09:45.541 --> 09:46.875
Will anyone come ever again!

09:48.333 --> 09:51.083
What you said was correct.
That fear should be there.

09:51.208 --> 09:52.416
Otherwise we had it.

09:53.583 --> 09:56.458
These new pricks who sprouted yesterday,
will walk around strutting their chests,

09:56.625 --> 09:57.958
should we watch and keep quiet!

09:59.041 --> 10:00.958
Now and then we should do
something like this,

10:01.041 --> 10:02.666
otherwise they show us their true colors.

10:03.541 --> 10:04.458
No…

10:04.916 --> 10:06.458
Even after so much has happened,

10:06.750 --> 10:09.125
Jyoti hasn't filed a police complaint.

10:09.583 --> 10:12.166
Maybe he is planning something else?

10:12.250 --> 10:13.166
Bullshit!

10:13.250 --> 10:14.750
The way he was battered,

10:14.833 --> 10:17.083
he will never dream of coming near
Baththa!

10:18.916 --> 10:21.416
PATIENTS SHOULD TAKE
THEIR MEDICATION ON TIME

10:29.041 --> 10:29.916
Jyoti,

10:30.791 --> 10:32.250
Baththa won't let us live.

10:33.125 --> 10:36.333
Only if we finish him,
can we survive.

10:37.208 --> 10:39.500
I will organize some really
experienced hands.

10:40.208 --> 10:41.375
We can finish the job smoothly.

10:52.333 --> 10:53.208
Thenu…

10:53.833 --> 10:54.708
Dad.

10:55.208 --> 10:56.291
Watching TV, is it?

10:58.208 --> 10:59.291
Watch… Watch…

11:17.541 --> 11:19.250
Kannimaa…

11:20.250 --> 11:22.166
What?

11:23.208 --> 11:24.125
Hey!

11:24.458 --> 11:25.916
You have hit him so badly.

11:26.458 --> 11:27.958
Have you gone crazy?

11:28.708 --> 11:29.833
What if he had died?

11:31.125 --> 11:32.750
That's the only thing you
haven't done yet.

11:33.791 --> 11:34.916
Do that also and go to jail.

11:37.875 --> 11:40.125
When you fell in love with me,
what did you say?

11:43.000 --> 11:44.125
I said you were beautiful…

11:50.250 --> 11:51.291
You keep doing this.

11:51.500 --> 11:54.291
One day or the other,
won't they take revenge?

11:55.333 --> 11:56.333
What if something happens to you?

11:58.375 --> 11:59.833
Do you even think of us?

12:06.208 --> 12:08.833
Hey! This is Baththa!

12:09.583 --> 12:10.458
Baththa!

12:16.541 --> 12:18.250
Who has the guts to finish me!

12:30.875 --> 12:31.833
Dad!

12:35.333 --> 12:36.541
Don't simply act dad.

12:42.208 --> 12:43.541
This is what I sang as well.

12:59.500 --> 13:00.375
What is this?

13:00.708 --> 13:01.583
Can't you see what it is?

13:01.666 --> 13:02.583
Tomato chutney.

13:02.791 --> 13:03.916
Same crap every day?

13:04.500 --> 13:05.500
What do you mean everyday?

13:06.250 --> 13:07.125
Yesterday it was fish curry.

13:07.333 --> 13:08.750
The day before it was intestine gravy.

13:08.875 --> 13:10.291
What is wrong if you have chutney today?

13:10.541 --> 13:11.750
Shall I serve or no?

13:12.708 --> 13:13.583
Serve!

13:22.500 --> 13:23.375
Dad!

13:23.750 --> 13:24.625
You sit.

13:26.041 --> 13:27.041
It's so sweet.

13:27.875 --> 13:29.083
For years you've been making this chutney,

13:30.083 --> 13:31.916
and still you don't know how much tomato,
how much onion,

13:32.000 --> 13:33.625
and how many green chilies are required.

13:34.166 --> 13:35.083
Yet, you have such a big mouth!

13:43.000 --> 13:44.708
It's gonna be only
tomato chutney to my grave.

13:45.583 --> 13:46.458
Ma, give it here.

13:49.291 --> 13:50.583
It's nice only, dad.

13:53.458 --> 13:54.375
Wait, I'll make something else.

14:05.583 --> 14:06.500
Hey!

14:09.000 --> 14:10.458
You have to go outside now and
get wasted, isn't it?

14:43.125 --> 14:44.750
Why you talking to yourself?

14:46.500 --> 14:47.500
Give me one strong tea.

14:53.291 --> 14:54.166
Rusk?

15:08.625 --> 15:09.541
Hey!

15:12.375 --> 15:13.375
Who the heck is that?

15:15.250 --> 15:16.166
What the…

15:21.666 --> 15:23.000
I'll kill you!

15:59.083 --> 15:59.958
Brother!

16:00.750 --> 16:01.625
Brother!

16:02.583 --> 16:04.000
