16:05.250 --> 16:06.125
Come here.

16:07.041 --> 16:07.916
Come.

16:08.000 --> 16:08.875
No brother! No brother!

16:08.958 --> 16:09.833
I said it by mistake.

16:11.875 --> 16:13.958
It's the stone that held the clothes

16:14.541 --> 16:15.500
I have my doubts.

16:25.666 --> 16:26.750
Baththa left.

16:27.291 --> 16:29.541
You don't spare anyone and fight with
everyone in the area,

16:30.291 --> 16:31.500
