17:03.708 --> 17:06.875
The Area's Only Don! Everything is
under his control, The Leader!

17:07.041 --> 17:09.916
Baththa has to dart a look
That look propels the story

17:10.000 --> 17:12.541
If he lifts his collar…
The rampage will begin…

17:12.666 --> 17:16.166
If you plan to oppose him
No one can escape

17:16.250 --> 17:19.333
The heart will stop
All you loitering wastrels

17:19.541 --> 17:22.416
Move aside you nincompoops
Always thrashed only big guns!

17:22.500 --> 17:24.958
Never touched small fry
Forget the Bravado

17:25.041 --> 17:26.958
