17:27.041 --> 17:28.708
Once he exhibits his prowess

17:28.791 --> 17:30.333
You losers will come to your senses

17:30.416 --> 17:31.916
Don't you dare come here
Don't forget who HE is!

17:32.000 --> 17:33.250
Don't play sly games

17:33.333 --> 17:34.833
Don't get caught and be doomed

17:34.916 --> 17:37.583
Don't play sly games
Don't forget who HE is!

17:37.666 --> 17:39.208
Don't you dare come and argue

17:39.291 --> 17:41.125
If he punches , you'd be minced

17:41.208 --> 17:43.958
If you get caught
you'd be mentally screwed

17:44.083 --> 17:47.166
If you get attached to him
He will like you very much

17:47.250 --> 17:48.958
He will like you very much

17:49.041 --> 17:50.458
If you get caught you'd be mentally
screwed

17:50.541 --> 17:53.583
If you get close to him
If he punches, you'd be minced

18:05.916 --> 18:07.708
You're gonna under estimate him

18:07.791 --> 18:12.666
And touch him
You losers roaming around, showing off

18:12.750 --> 18:15.708
Will be dead with no proof
You're gonna under estimate him

18:15.833 --> 18:17.250
And touch him

18:17.333 --> 18:21.250
If you decide to hunt him you're doomed,
Pray to the Lord!

18:21.333 --> 18:24.458
You will Tremble at the sound of His
