The rampage will begin…
If you plan to oppose him

19:12.083 --> 19:14.625
No one can escape
The heart will stop

19:14.708 --> 19:17.583
You're gonna under estimate him
And touch him

19:17.666 --> 19:19.916
You losers roaming around showing off
Will be dead with no proof

19:33.333 --> 19:34.291
Kannima!

19:35.666 --> 19:37.083
Hey! Kannima!

19:46.083 --> 19:47.166
You're here is it!

19:50.541 --> 19:52.041
I've been calling you.

19:57.500 --> 19:58.583
What is this?

20:01.291 --> 20:02.708
Is this how a house should be?

20:04.250 --> 20:05.333
Where have you been since the morning?

20:05.958 --> 20:07.208
Where all do we have to search for you?

20:09.916 --> 20:11.208
You shouldn't search for me.

20:12.541 --> 20:13.666
I'll be found on my own!

20:13.916 --> 20:14.875
That's Baththa!

20:15.958 --> 20:17.041
Why did you search for me?

20:17.291 --> 20:18.791
Why did you search for me?

20:27.791 --> 20:28.708
What is it…

20:42.916 --> 20:43.958
When?

20:45.500 --> 20:46.958
-Thenu…
-Don't wake her up.

20:47.125 --> 20:48.333
From the morning she's been
asking for you.

20:48.458 --> 20:49.666
She just slept.

20:50.791 --> 20:52.041
My daughter!

20:54.833 --> 20:55.708
Hey, Thenu…

20:55.791 --> 20:57.916
You are going next to her, stinking
of liquor, go.

20:59.166 --> 21:00.500
See her in the morning, now go.

21:07.666 --> 21:10.083
This whole area will be stunned
by the way I conduct,

21:10.875 --> 21:14.333
my daughter's puberty function.
Wait and see.

21:19.125 --> 21:20.125
This is a promise.

21:22.833 --> 21:23.708
Go…

21:26.583 --> 21:27.500
Go!

21:53.958 --> 21:56.250
There is an auspicious date in May,
let me check and tell you.

21:57.000 --> 21:57.916
Okay.

22:04.541 --> 22:05.458
What are you doing?

22:07.041 --> 22:08.041
Is this the place to play?

22:08.250 --> 22:09.208
Have you finished writing?

22:11.000 --> 22:11.875
Leave.

22:18.958 --> 22:19.833
Go, now.

22:21.958 --> 22:24.166
When you have finished so fast,
what could you have possibly written!

22:49.791 --> 22:50.875
Hand it over one by one.

22:52.500 --> 22:54.083
Sabari! You haven't left?

22:54.208 --> 22:56.166
The toy is with the teacher…

22:56.500 --> 22:58.750
Oh! You better stay, get it and go.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.541
After this, we go into the 4th standard.

23:00.833 --> 23:02.666
It might get lost during the holidays.

23:12.666 --> 23:13.583
Ma'am…

23:15.875 --> 23:16.875
Ma'am…

23:35.583 --> 23:38.125
-You're cheating in my presence itself,
-Sir…

23:38.208 --> 23:40.250
-I won't do it from now on, sir.
-What guts you've got!

23:59.500 --> 24:02.583
Even before the peak summer sets in, the
heat is scorching!

24:02.791 --> 24:03.666
Yes!

24:03.875 --> 24:06.125
It's unbearable, it might just kill us!

24:06.208 --> 24:07.291
You know what,

24:07.583 --> 24:09.666
yesterday our school watchman Govind,

24:09.750 --> 24:12.166
couldn't bear the heat,he felt dizzy and
fainted.

24:12.416 --> 24:14.583
He was lying there unconscious
for a long time,

24:14.833 --> 24:17.458
finally, milkman Babu who
was passing by saw him,

24:17.541 --> 24:19.958
with the help of a few others, he put him
into a rickshaw,

24:20.041 --> 24:21.458
and took him to The General Hospital!

24:21.958 --> 24:22.833
Nothing serious, right?

24:23.041 --> 24:24.583
Nothing life threatening, it seems.

24:24.666 --> 24:27.833
Poor guy, don't know if he will be able to
go for work again.

24:28.041 --> 24:29.541
Why was he lying there unconscious for a
long time?

24:29.666 --> 24:30.750
Didn't anyone from school see him?

24:30.833 --> 24:32.916
School closed for the holidays
two weeks ago.

24:33.041 --> 24:35.958
Guess the staff had finished all their
work, no one was there.

24:36.041 --> 24:37.083
He was alone.

24:37.166 --> 24:39.916
Till the school reopens no one has any
work that side.

24:44.125 --> 24:46.500
Why have you unnecessarily booked a light
music orchestra?

24:48.250 --> 24:49.541
Can't you allow me watch in peace?

24:52.666 --> 24:56.291
Keep believing

24:58.625 --> 25:02.916
Tomorrow is ours

25:03.625 --> 25:07.458
Today is ours too

25:35.166 --> 25:36.541
MAHALAKSHMI SILKS

26:55.458 --> 27:02.375
TEACHERS' ROOM

28:03.791 --> 28:08.125
GENTS TOILET

29:08.250 --> 29:09.375
Hey! Who has locked it?

29:11.291 --> 29:12.166
Hey!

29:13.208 --> 29:14.333
Can't you see someone's here!

29:15.375 --> 29:16.250
Open the door.

29:17.583 --> 29:18.541
I'm telling you to open it!

29:24.541 --> 29:25.541
Hey!

29:27.125 --> 29:28.083
Who is that?

29:30.125 --> 29:31.250
Are you going to open the door or not?

29:35.125 --> 29:36.875
If you don't open the door…

29:40.083 --> 29:41.958
That's better…

29:42.708 --> 29:44.208
You know who I am, right?

29:46.125 --> 29:47.041
Baththa!

29:49.333 --> 29:51.291
Hey! When I come out,

29:52.208 --> 29:53.541
I'll kill you!

29:56.708 --> 29:57.625
Hey…

29:59.041 --> 30:00.166
Open the door…

30:01.541 --> 30:02.750
Open the door…

30:04.791 --> 30:05.958
I am asking you to open the door!

30:06.833 --> 30:07.791
Hey…

30:27.458 --> 30:28.708
Hey! Open the door!

30:29.916 --> 30:30.916
Hey!

30:32.125 --> 30:33.666
Who is there?

30:35.958 --> 30:36.875
Hey!

30:38.458 --> 30:39.333
Hey!

30:40.750 --> 30:41.958
Hey! Open the door!

30:43.875 --> 30:44.875
Bloody hell!

30:46.250 --> 30:47.833
am asking you to open, isn't it!

30:48.791 --> 30:50.416
If I come out, you are done!

30:51.125 --> 30:52.458
You have no clue about me.

30:53.208 --> 30:54.333
You better open it.

31:10.750 --> 31:11.666
Where did you go?

31:13.583 --> 31:15.291
I just went out.

31:15.750 --> 31:17.958
Mister, what work did you have, to go out
early in the morning?

31:20.166 --> 31:21.416
Went to play.

31:22.291 --> 31:23.750
Who is coming at this hour to play?

31:24.250 --> 31:25.708
No one came,

31:26.500 --> 31:27.666
that's why I got back.

31:27.875 --> 31:30.041
How silly! I've been searching for you.

31:30.250 --> 31:31.958
I made tea for you, it's growing cold,
drink it up.

31:38.125 --> 31:41.458
Once the police caught him and
put him in jail,

31:41.541 --> 31:45.458
he broke all the jail bars,
flung it and came out.

31:45.666 --> 31:48.833
GENTS TOILET

31:50.625 --> 31:51.500
Baththa!

31:54.291 --> 31:55.166
Hey!

31:55.583 --> 31:56.500
You haven't had the tea.

32:08.833 --> 32:11.458
KEEP THE TOILET CLEAN

32:15.875 --> 32:22.625
KEEP THE TOILET CLEAN

32:24.458 --> 32:26.208
Is this a toilet or a safe?

32:27.375 --> 32:28.916
Why such a door?

33:29.583 --> 33:30.500
Who is this?

33:32.333 --> 33:33.708
If I catch you…

33:34.416 --> 33:36.166
Shameless rouge!

33:50.000 --> 33:51.166
Oh ! My leg!

34:02.333 --> 34:03.291
Welcome…

34:06.541 --> 34:07.458
You'd say that, wouldn't you?

34:07.541 --> 34:09.125
Ask anyone you want in the area.

34:09.416 --> 34:11.125
Others know me well, too.

34:14.666 --> 34:15.708
After her you go.

34:15.791 --> 34:16.708
Okay, Sister…

34:17.125 --> 34:18.625
-Hey, Selvi.
-Yes, sister.

34:19.041 --> 34:20.000
Hey, Kannima.

34:20.583 --> 34:21.458
Baththa hasn't come?

34:21.708 --> 34:22.583
No.

34:22.875 --> 34:24.041
He went out in the morning,

34:24.583 --> 34:26.083
didn't say where he was going.

34:26.291 --> 34:27.666
We waited and waited,

34:27.750 --> 34:29.125
then Thenu and me got ready and came.

34:29.250 --> 34:31.500
He told me he will definitely come.

34:31.791 --> 34:33.125
Where did he go without telling you?

34:33.208 --> 34:34.208
He's like that.

34:34.625 --> 34:35.833
He never tells me anything.

34:36.416 --> 34:38.083
If he told me, I will be in peace, right!

34:38.500 --> 34:40.041
If he's like others, then it's fine.

34:40.291 --> 34:41.958
He won't stay out of trouble.

34:42.166 --> 34:44.291
Why you unnecessarily overthinking?

34:44.458 --> 34:46.583
Just wait and see, he will be here before
the function gets over.

34:46.708 --> 34:48.041
Alright, you wait, I'll be back.

34:48.125 --> 34:49.125
Okay, sister…

34:54.916 --> 34:55.791
Here.

35:02.750 --> 35:04.333
-Do you want?
-Yes.

35:09.583 --> 35:10.875
If you need anything ask, Selvi.

35:12.500 --> 35:14.833
-Delhi, there is no rice here.
-I'm coming.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.291
Durai…
Take the 'Rasam'

35:16.500 --> 35:17.375
For you?

35:17.833 --> 35:18.791
Enough.

35:19.833 --> 35:20.708
Rice?

35:21.541 --> 35:22.416
I don't want.

35:23.041 --> 35:23.916
Just eat.

35:27.583 --> 35:28.708
He's been missing since morning.

35:29.416 --> 35:31.125
Do you guys know where he
could have gone?

35:31.583 --> 35:32.541
Don't know, Sister.

35:34.083 --> 35:35.291
He left without saying anything.

35:35.958 --> 35:36.875
We'll look for him, Sister…

35:43.625 --> 35:46.458
It's around one in the afternoon.

35:47.375 --> 35:51.083
April 26th.

35:51.625 --> 35:54.416
Saturday. Jesus…

35:54.500 --> 35:55.916
Hey! Baththa here!

35:57.583 --> 35:59.333
I'm inside the school bathroom!

36:01.458 --> 36:03.166
Someone come and open this door!

36:05.000 --> 36:06.500
I am Baththa speaking!

36:08.416 --> 36:09.958
Can anyone hear me?

36:13.041 --> 36:15.625
Someone better hear me!

36:17.000 --> 36:18.208
Delhi!

36:27.583 --> 36:28.875
I've looked everywhere,

36:28.958 --> 36:29.833
he's not anywhere.

36:32.458 --> 36:33.958
He used to go see someone
in Pazhaverkadu.

36:34.333 --> 36:35.541
Could he have gone there?

36:36.291 --> 36:37.166
No,

36:37.291 --> 36:38.875
he won't go there without telling us.

36:41.750 --> 36:42.833
He will be back.

36:43.208 --> 36:44.458
Anyways we will go check there.

36:45.916 --> 36:46.833
Okay.

37:39.083 --> 37:39.958
Oh my god.

38:07.125 --> 38:09.083
GOVERNMENT HIGHER SECONDARY SCHOOL

38:12.750 --> 38:13.958
It's not bending at all.

38:25.500 --> 38:28.750
Lord Kaathavarayan is ready for the hunt!

38:28.833 --> 38:31.083
The Goddess is on a hunger hunt!

38:31.166 --> 38:32.416
The enemy has no chance against him!

38:32.500 --> 38:34.791
This is Baththa's Baththavatharam!

38:36.291 --> 38:37.166
Eat.

38:41.083 --> 38:42.083
Why have you kept it like that?

38:42.166 --> 38:43.500
-I'm not hungry.
-Why?

38:45.125 --> 38:46.208
You didn't eat anything this morning.

38:46.291 --> 38:48.166
You didn't eat anything at Sampoornam's
house this afternoon either.

38:48.250 --> 38:49.125
Eat!

38:49.541 --> 38:50.875
I'm saying I don't want to!

38:50.958 --> 38:52.083
You're going to get whacked!

38:52.166 --> 38:54.333
You have such a puny body
because you refuse to eat!

38:54.458 --> 38:55.625
Only when you fall sick will you realize!

38:55.750 --> 38:57.416
People are dying of hunger,

38:57.500 --> 38:58.833
and I'm preparing everything for you,
but you're acting so entitled!

38:58.916 --> 38:59.791
Selvi.

39:04.583 --> 39:05.541
Dad.

39:06.916 --> 39:09.375
Will they die if they don't eat?

39:09.791 --> 39:11.416
Yes. Absolutely!

39:16.125 --> 39:17.000
Eat.

39:34.583 --> 39:35.583
What are you doing?

39:36.333 --> 39:37.208
Nothing!

40:02.708 --> 40:06.791
At 8:00 a.m., you are listening
to All India Radio.

40:12.041 --> 40:13.041
What is this?

40:13.333 --> 40:14.666
I'll go sleep on the terrace.

40:15.458 --> 40:16.333
Why?

40:16.416 --> 40:17.750
It's very humid here.

40:17.833 --> 40:19.125
I'm not getting sleep.

40:19.333 --> 40:20.666
The fan is on right?

40:20.750 --> 40:22.375
In spite of that it's hot.

40:22.458 --> 40:24.083
On the terrace the breeze is very cool.

40:24.166 --> 40:25.666
How will you sleep alone?

40:25.875 --> 40:27.916
Everyone is sleeping there.

40:28.125 --> 40:29.041
Okay, I'll also come.

40:29.833 --> 40:31.500
Grandpa from the opposite house is also
sleeping there,

40:31.583 --> 40:32.708
I'll sleep with him.

40:33.625 --> 40:35.416
Go tell him and make him sleep there.

40:56.791 --> 40:58.125
Where you going?

41:01.625 --> 41:02.500
Okay, go.

41:06.500 --> 41:10.250
Lord Muruga! Lord Muruga!

41:10.333 --> 41:13.625
Lord Muruga! Lord Muruga!

41:14.375 --> 41:18.541
Lord Muruga! Lord Muruga!

41:19.375 --> 41:24.583
Lord Muruga! Lord Muruga!

41:25.041 --> 41:25.916
Uncle…

41:26.000 --> 41:26.875
What?

42:13.625 --> 42:14.500
Hey!

42:16.541 --> 42:17.791
Who are you?

42:19.916 --> 42:21.000
Open the door!

42:21.583 --> 42:23.250
How many days have you followed me?

42:30.750 --> 42:32.000
Open the door!

42:35.916 --> 42:36.791
Hey!

42:38.416 --> 42:39.458
Open will you!

42:41.125 --> 42:42.208
Who is it?

42:44.166 --> 42:45.083
Who?

42:46.833 --> 42:47.750
Jyoti?

42:49.000 --> 42:50.000
Speak up!

42:50.250 --> 42:51.458
Is it Jyoti?

42:54.750 --> 42:55.916
Rajendra?

42:59.333 --> 43:00.375
Selvam?

43:02.291 --> 43:03.291
Tell me…

43:04.125 --> 43:05.416
Is it Selvam?

43:09.791 --> 43:10.750
Singaram?

43:11.666 --> 43:14.000
Hey! Singaram.

43:19.125 --> 43:20.125
Pedda Kondaiah?

43:23.958 --> 43:25.375
Are you Pedda Kondaiah's man?

43:30.500 --> 43:32.083
I've been asking you for so long,

43:32.208 --> 43:33.250
won't you reply?

43:34.375 --> 43:37.083
I'll find out who you are from
your smell itself.

43:37.583 --> 43:38.625
Hey! it's me Baththa!

43:41.125 --> 43:42.416
Won't you answer?

43:43.458 --> 43:45.916
If I don't get home by tonight,

43:46.500 --> 43:48.583
The whole area will be a battlefield!

43:49.291 --> 43:50.958
A river of blood will flow!

43:53.833 --> 43:56.833
Guess, you have no clue about my homies,

43:56.916 --> 43:58.875
by now they would have sniffed you out!

44:00.125 --> 44:02.375
Whoever you are,
they will finish you and your family!

44:05.041 --> 44:07.208
I think you've done this,
without knowing about me!

44:09.208 --> 44:10.166
Open the door!

44:11.333 --> 44:12.500
That's only safe for you.

44:13.541 --> 44:14.416
Come…

44:16.000 --> 44:16.875
Come and open the door.

44:17.291 --> 44:18.333
I'm saying this for your good.

44:20.916 --> 44:21.791
Come…

44:24.625 --> 44:25.583
Come…

44:49.375 --> 44:50.291
Hey!

44:51.916 --> 44:53.541
Who am I…

44:55.500 --> 44:57.625
You're giving me rusk,
like for a dog!

44:59.041 --> 45:01.750
Gonna bloody smash you to the ground,
and hammer you to pulp!

45:02.625 --> 45:04.208
Hey, stop!

45:04.291 --> 45:09.791
Hey! Don't run… Don't run…

45:09.875 --> 45:10.958
I won't do anything.

45:11.041 --> 45:12.000
Hey! Hey!

45:12.083 --> 45:16.791
Hey! Don't run… Don't run…

45:53.583 --> 45:55.875
If I don't go home by tonight…

45:55.958 --> 45:57.875
The whole area will be a battlefield!

45:57.958 --> 45:59.625
A river of blood will flow…

46:31.458 --> 46:32.333
Sabari…

46:33.875 --> 46:35.416
There is money in dad's
shirt pocket, take it.

46:35.791 --> 46:37.625
Go buy milk and come.

46:40.750 --> 46:42.291
Why have you woken up so early?

46:43.375 --> 46:44.416
Just like that.

46:46.875 --> 46:47.958
Uncle, rusk?

47:04.541 --> 47:06.583
Come… Come…

47:07.250 --> 47:08.291
You've come?

47:11.208 --> 47:12.458
I get it now,

47:13.791 --> 47:16.916
if you've had the guts to lock me
up in my own area,

47:17.750 --> 47:19.916
you're no cheapskate,

47:20.791 --> 47:22.166
Tell me what you want?

47:22.625 --> 47:23.958
Why have you locked me up like this?

47:24.583 --> 47:25.916
What have I done to you?

47:26.541 --> 47:28.958
What's the point in locking me up and not
telling me anything.

47:29.958 --> 47:30.833
Hey!

47:30.916 --> 47:31.791
Hey!

47:31.875 --> 47:33.500
For the past two days,
only I've been talking.

47:34.000 --> 47:35.375
Have you spoken a single word?

47:35.666 --> 47:36.583
Tell me!

47:36.833 --> 47:38.166
Only if you tell me,
will I know!

47:38.583 --> 47:39.750
Are you dumb?!

47:40.375 --> 47:41.333
Are you dumb?

47:47.125 --> 47:49.000
Whatever it is, we can solve it.

47:50.708 --> 47:52.125
Hey! This is a toilet.

47:52.208 --> 47:53.541
It stinks in various ways.

47:53.625 --> 47:54.791
It is unbearable.

47:55.583 --> 47:56.750
What do you want?

47:57.500 --> 47:58.750
You don't know about Baththa.

47:59.750 --> 48:02.750
I am a very angry man
but am equally just.

48:03.875 --> 48:05.625
If something wrong has happened,
we can set it right.

48:06.791 --> 48:07.666
Come.

48:09.041 --> 48:10.125
Come and first open the door.

48:10.333 --> 48:11.208
Come…

48:14.416 --> 48:15.958
I won't do anything to you.

48:16.583 --> 48:17.666
I have nothing in my hand.

48:18.583 --> 48:20.291
If you want,
go bring all your people.

48:20.750 --> 48:22.375
Safeguard yourself.

48:23.375 --> 48:24.583
I am not scared at all.

48:24.875 --> 48:25.750
What?

48:26.875 --> 48:28.125
Am I not alone?

48:29.375 --> 48:30.333
Come, open the door.

48:31.791 --> 48:32.666
What say?

48:43.666 --> 48:45.791
I am respecting you and saying so much…

48:48.125 --> 48:49.666
…and you are again keeping rusk!

48:51.833 --> 48:52.708
Open it!

48:52.791 --> 48:54.000
What the hell do you think of yourself!

48:54.750 --> 48:55.916
Open the door!

48:56.958 --> 48:57.833
Hey!

48:57.958 --> 48:58.833
Hey! Hey!

48:58.916 --> 48:59.833
Don't run!

48:59.916 --> 49:01.625
Don't… Hey!

49:01.708 --> 49:04.375
Don't run! Don't run!

49:05.833 --> 49:07.250
Hey! Just wait and see what I do to you!

49:07.750 --> 49:08.791
Just wait and see what I do to you!

49:08.916 --> 49:09.791
You're dead!

49:09.916 --> 49:10.916
You're dead!

49:11.541 --> 49:13.541
If I don't thrash you and hang you
on the electric pole!

49:13.750 --> 49:14.958
I am not Baththa!

49:15.208 --> 49:17.041
I am not Baththa!

49:17.333 --> 49:18.375
Hey!

49:29.500 --> 49:31.250
Why is you're shirt soaked
in sweat like this?

49:33.666 --> 49:35.083
I bought milk and came right?

49:35.833 --> 49:37.958
Is it such a difficult task for you?

49:39.833 --> 49:40.750
POLICE STATION

49:40.875 --> 49:43.125
It's just been a day,
let's wait and see.

49:43.375 --> 49:45.500
No sir, this has never happened before.

49:46.125 --> 49:48.416
Either I'll know,
or they will know.

49:49.541 --> 49:51.083
Are you suspicious of anyone?

49:51.166 --> 49:52.625
-Yes sir.
-Who?

49:52.833 --> 49:54.625
I suspect around 4 or 5 of them.

49:54.750 --> 49:55.958
Especially Jyoti…

49:56.041 --> 49:56.916
Then…

49:57.000 --> 49:58.916
-Rajendran…
-Rajendran…

49:59.291 --> 50:00.250
Singaram…

50:00.416 --> 50:01.583
Kodungaiyur Selvam…

50:01.916 --> 50:02.958
Then, pedda kondaiah…

50:03.958 --> 50:05.625
All the names you just mentioned,

50:05.708 --> 50:07.583
and why you suspect them,
go give him all the details in writing.

50:07.666 --> 50:08.625
Okay,sir.

50:09.958 --> 50:11.208
You leave,
we will take care.

50:13.666 --> 50:14.583
Okay.

50:49.875 --> 50:53.416
BATHTHA IS IN THE SCHOOL TOILET

51:16.916 --> 51:20.666
Without looking around!

51:20.750 --> 51:24.625
Don't fool around!

51:24.750 --> 51:28.833
Crying is a mistake!
Fear is also a mistake!

51:28.916 --> 51:32.250
Let any challenge be thrown,
You face it!

51:32.375 --> 51:36.166
I will live with the brave heart,
I will be this country's hero!

51:36.250 --> 51:37.125
Bravo!

51:37.208 --> 51:38.083
Hey!

51:43.208 --> 51:45.041
Someone's missing in the locality,

51:47.541 --> 51:48.541
without searching for him,

51:49.500 --> 51:50.833
they are listening to music.

51:54.250 --> 51:55.291
Anyone at home?

51:55.666 --> 51:56.583
Who?

52:00.458 --> 52:01.333
What, sir?

52:01.583 --> 52:02.833
Is Pedda kondaiah here?

52:03.041 --> 52:04.041
Who is that?

52:05.791 --> 52:06.708
What news?

52:06.833 --> 52:08.166
The Sub-Inspector asked you
to meet him at the station.

52:09.625 --> 52:10.666
You go, I'll come.

52:12.291 --> 52:13.166
Why?

52:14.333 --> 52:16.791
Two days, Baththa has been missing.

52:17.791 --> 52:19.583
That's why he must be wanting to see me.

52:23.041 --> 52:23.958
Hey!

52:24.291 --> 52:25.541
Why you looking at me like that?

52:25.791 --> 52:27.000
I haven't done anything.

52:27.333 --> 52:28.291
Then…

52:30.666 --> 52:32.291
That's what I can't figure,

52:32.750 --> 52:34.833
who has done it.

52:35.541 --> 52:37.250
Let go, whose house are you coming and
doing what!

52:37.625 --> 52:38.958
Why you all gawking?

52:39.250 --> 52:42.708
If something happens to Baththa,
I will destroy you!

52:42.791 --> 52:45.291
-For that, you have to be alive first.
-Get lost!

52:46.166 --> 52:47.875
They don't have the balls
to catch the culprit,

52:47.958 --> 52:49.333
they've come here!

53:28.041 --> 53:28.916
Thenu…

53:29.166 --> 53:30.041
What?

53:31.083 --> 53:31.958
Mom?

53:32.625 --> 53:34.125
Dad will be back, right?

53:36.375 --> 53:37.791
I am getting scared, Ma.

53:38.833 --> 53:39.750
Don't get scared.

53:40.166 --> 53:41.083
Dad will be back.

53:42.375 --> 53:44.583
I am going on thinking of dad.

53:48.250 --> 53:49.291
Sleep.

54:03.208 --> 54:05.958
Just see what will happen to your
wife and children.

54:19.666 --> 54:20.750
What are you doing?

54:23.541 --> 54:24.750
I'll go buy milk and come.

54:37.708 --> 54:38.583
Come…

54:39.000 --> 54:39.875
You've come?

54:40.666 --> 54:41.916
Why are you doing this?

54:42.500 --> 54:43.708
Who are you guys?

54:44.166 --> 54:45.708
What have I done to you that's so bad?

54:46.875 --> 54:48.125
At least tell me that.

54:48.500 --> 54:50.708
Without saying anything, you're killing
me. What does this mean?

54:51.458 --> 54:53.666
I've been trying to recollect, from my
school days,

54:53.750 --> 54:55.750
with whom all I've had fights.
My brain's fried.

55:00.125 --> 55:02.541
Hey! What is it? You powdering
the rusk is it?

55:03.916 --> 55:04.875
Hey! Don't!

55:05.666 --> 55:06.750
Open the door.

55:12.250 --> 55:13.583
So, you're never going to open, is it?

55:15.000 --> 55:16.875
No matter what the problem
is between you and me,

55:17.291 --> 55:18.875
I promise I will give in.

55:19.625 --> 55:21.458
I promise on my wife and child.

55:25.708 --> 55:26.625
Hey!

55:26.875 --> 55:27.875
Open the door.

55:28.916 --> 55:29.833
Hey!

55:34.250 --> 55:35.333
Hey! Don't go!

55:35.500 --> 55:36.750
Don't go!

55:36.833 --> 55:37.791
Don't go!

55:37.875 --> 55:40.166
My wife and daughter will be so frightened
at home. Don't go.

55:40.291 --> 55:41.875
Hey! Poor thing, my daughter!

55:42.208 --> 55:43.333
Don't go!

55:43.625 --> 55:45.541
Hey! Hey!

56:02.083 --> 56:03.458
While he was seated there…

56:03.541 --> 56:04.875
Sir, a stone fell from above.

56:07.791 --> 56:09.625
Just like your dad,
a scaredy-cat!

57:44.958 --> 57:45.833
Thenu…

57:58.375 --> 57:59.250
Thenu…

58:02.375 --> 58:04.291
Dad will be back…

58:09.833 --> 58:10.833
Kannima…

58:11.291 --> 58:12.250
Kannima…

58:12.458 --> 58:14.166
Take care of Thenu.

58:14.791 --> 58:15.875
Thenu…

58:20.708 --> 58:24.541
O! My Life! My Life! My Life!

58:24.791 --> 58:26.791
O! My Sweet one!
O! My Every word!

58:26.875 --> 58:28.833
O! My Child!
O! My Divine fruit!

58:28.916 --> 58:32.375
O! My Daughter!
O! My Daughter!

58:33.000 --> 58:36.125
O! My Princess!
O! My Angel!

58:37.375 --> 58:38.458
You keep doing this.

58:38.833 --> 58:40.666
One day I will tell the police myself.

58:40.791 --> 58:41.875
That you're making arrack.

58:44.625 --> 58:45.625
While eating,

58:46.375 --> 58:47.500
going on and on.

58:49.208 --> 58:50.083
Thenu, eat.

58:50.458 --> 58:51.458
Eat now!

58:52.250 --> 58:54.333
The wedded one's face to see

58:54.458 --> 58:56.416
The offspring's voice to hear

58:56.500 --> 58:58.541
The daughter's lap to sleep on

58:58.625 --> 59:00.625
To blossom in her laughter

59:00.708 --> 59:02.708
To pour my heart out

59:02.791 --> 59:04.708
To bond again!

59:04.833 --> 59:06.875
To see everything in new light!

59:06.958 --> 59:09.583
I yearn for!

59:10.208 --> 59:12.375
Every new second is blossoming!

59:12.458 --> 59:14.458
Every new second is in waiting!

59:14.541 --> 59:15.958
It is coming alive for you

59:16.041 --> 59:18.291
To say something

59:18.541 --> 59:20.458
O! The heart ! The heart! That
obstructs!

59:20.541 --> 59:22.666
In unconsciousness one suffers

59:22.750 --> 59:26.708
In awakening life will slowly dawn!

59:26.791 --> 59:28.666
-Did you get the signal?
-No!

59:28.750 --> 59:30.291
-It hasn’t come yet.
-Now?

59:30.375 --> 59:32.416
-Yes, it has come.
-Yes, it has come!

59:32.500 --> 59:34.458
It's gone. Change the direction!

59:34.583 --> 59:36.375
Change the direction! Change it!

59:36.833 --> 59:39.250
-Has it come back?
-In unconsciousness one suffers

59:39.333 --> 59:41.833
-It's come back, okay, okay.
-In awakening life will slowly dawn!

59:41.916 --> 59:43.708
Please keep it as it is…
you come down.

59:44.208 --> 59:47.916
The lesson has been learnt…

59:48.458 --> 59:52.375
The lesson has been learnt…

59:52.458 --> 59:56.708
The lesson has been learnt…

59:56.833 --> 01:00:00.000
The lesson has been learnt…

01:00:00.083 --> 01:00:04.041
O! My Life! My Life! My Life!

01:00:04.125 --> 01:00:06.125
O! My Sweet one!
O! My Every word!

01:00:06.208 --> 01:00:08.083
O! My Child!
O! My Divine fruit!

01:00:08.166 --> 01:00:12.291
O! My Daughter!
O! My Daughter!

01:00:12.375 --> 01:00:15.125
O! My Princess!
O! My Angel!

01:00:15.208 --> 01:00:17.291
The wedded one's face to see

01:00:17.375 --> 01:00:19.291
The offspring's voice to hear

01:00:19.375 --> 01:00:21.291
The daughter's lap to sleep on

01:00:21.375 --> 01:00:23.333
To blossom in her laughter

01:00:23.458 --> 01:00:25.458
To pour my heart out

01:00:25.541 --> 01:00:27.541
To bond again!

01:00:27.625 --> 01:00:29.625
To see everything in new light!

01:00:29.708 --> 01:00:33.000
I yearn for!

01:00:35.041 --> 01:00:39.000
4 DAYS LATER

01:00:49.416 --> 01:00:51.416
MURDER OF A PRISONER IN A CENTRAL PRISON

01:00:51.500 --> 01:00:52.375
Take it.

01:00:57.458 --> 01:00:58.625
-Baththa also hasn't come.
-Dad.

01:00:58.708 --> 01:01:00.083
-Enough Dad.
-The news also isn't out.

01:01:00.166 --> 01:01:01.375
It's been so many days.

01:01:03.791 --> 01:01:04.666
Hey…

01:01:04.958 --> 01:01:06.250
Hey… Please don't do this.

01:01:06.875 --> 01:01:08.333
I'll die.

01:01:09.625 --> 01:01:11.083
Please open the door.

01:01:22.875 --> 01:01:24.458
I have my daughter's puberty
function coming up.

01:01:25.833 --> 01:01:28.458
It's torturous to be alive and
not see my daughter.

01:01:29.625 --> 01:01:31.541
What can my daughter do, for all the sins
I've committed?

01:01:33.875 --> 01:01:35.041
I'm not asking for my sake…

01:01:36.333 --> 01:01:38.291
I'm asking for my daughter's sake…

01:01:42.333 --> 01:01:45.333
I didn't even buy flowers for my daughter
who has attained puberty.

01:01:49.500 --> 01:01:51.000
If you too had a daughter,

01:01:52.041 --> 01:01:53.291
and this had happened?

01:01:54.125 --> 01:01:55.125
Think about it…

01:01:57.041 --> 01:01:59.500
I am begging you.

01:02:04.125 --> 01:02:05.791
I won't look at you as an enemy.

01:02:06.375 --> 01:02:07.458
My friend!

01:02:09.291 --> 01:02:10.250
Come my friend!

01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:12.333
My friend! Come my friend!

01:02:13.208 --> 01:02:14.500
Come, please open the door.

01:02:18.083 --> 01:02:19.791
My friend…

01:02:20.125 --> 01:02:21.291
My friend, don't go.

01:02:21.750 --> 01:02:23.333
Open the door, my friend.

01:02:25.458 --> 01:02:27.916
Please open the door,
my friend.

01:02:37.208 --> 01:02:40.041
I can't stay without seeing my daughter,
my friend!

01:02:44.333 --> 01:02:45.208
Baththa!

01:02:45.291 --> 01:02:47.000
No Baththa! Stop this Baththa!
Leave him Baththa!

01:03:09.125 --> 01:03:11.666
KANNIYAMMA THENMOZHI

01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:15.958
Kannima,

01:03:16.791 --> 01:03:18.125
Kannima, you don't be scared.

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:20.125
I am still alive.

01:03:20.833 --> 01:03:22.125
I'll be back Kannima.

01:03:23.583 --> 01:03:25.666
Look after Thenu carefully.

01:03:27.750 --> 01:03:28.791
Take care of Thenu…

01:03:28.875 --> 01:03:30.458
Take care of her.

01:03:49.916 --> 01:03:51.250
Ma, where are we going?

01:03:51.333 --> 01:03:52.208
Come…

01:04:29.250 --> 01:04:30.208
Listen Delhi,

01:04:30.375 --> 01:04:32.416
it is 8 days since Baththa went missing.

01:04:34.416 --> 01:04:36.333
I think, his chapter is over.

01:04:37.625 --> 01:04:40.416
What happened and who did it
will come out when it has to.

01:04:40.500 --> 01:04:42.333
Next you will be in Baththa's shoes.

01:04:42.750 --> 01:04:44.791
Before anyone in the area sprouts,

01:04:44.916 --> 01:04:45.875
you takeover.

01:04:46.458 --> 01:04:48.291
The shop also has not been opened.

01:04:48.666 --> 01:04:49.666
Lowlife!

01:04:50.750 --> 01:04:51.916
who you acting smart with…

01:04:52.000 --> 01:04:53.291
Delhi… Delhi… Delhi…

01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:57.708
Once more you say that he's dead!

01:04:58.833 --> 01:05:00.291
I'll kill you on the spot!

01:05:00.916 --> 01:05:02.083
Baththa will be back!

01:06:15.166 --> 01:06:16.291
Don't need to buy milk today.

01:06:17.125 --> 01:06:18.000
Why?

01:06:18.083 --> 01:06:19.375
We are going to our native.

01:06:19.750 --> 01:06:20.625
Native?

01:06:21.500 --> 01:06:22.833
Why suddenly?

01:06:22.916 --> 01:06:23.791
What do you mean suddenly,

01:06:24.291 --> 01:06:26.250
don't we go every year for the
Chithirai festival.

01:06:29.041 --> 01:06:30.625
When will we be back?

01:06:30.958 --> 01:06:32.333
What you asking,
like it is something new.

01:06:32.875 --> 01:06:35.250
Once your holidays are over,
and school reopens is when we get back.

01:06:35.708 --> 01:06:37.375
Dad will be back after 5 days.

01:06:39.458 --> 01:06:40.750
I am not coming this year.

01:06:41.708 --> 01:06:42.625
Why?

01:06:43.166 --> 01:06:44.791
No, I am not coming.

01:06:44.875 --> 01:06:45.750
Not coming?

01:06:45.833 --> 01:06:47.458
Then are you going to stay here alone?

01:06:47.833 --> 01:06:48.916
I'll stay.

01:06:49.166 --> 01:06:51.000
Without me and dad, how can you stay here?

01:06:51.125 --> 01:06:52.541
One whack you'll get!
Go pack your clothes.

01:06:54.458 --> 01:06:55.375
Ask him,

01:06:55.583 --> 01:06:56.583
he doesn't want to come to the native?

01:06:58.000 --> 01:06:58.875
Why don't you want to come?

01:06:58.958 --> 01:07:00.333
No, I am not coming.

01:07:00.875 --> 01:07:03.041
You're the one excited about
going every year.

01:07:03.208 --> 01:07:04.083
Now what happened?

01:07:04.291 --> 01:07:05.708
This year I am not coming.

01:07:07.541 --> 01:07:08.708
But why?

01:07:09.125 --> 01:07:10.500
I am not coming, that's it.

01:07:11.083 --> 01:07:13.083
-Please stop repeating yourself.
-Hey, Selvi!

01:07:13.375 --> 01:07:14.333
Go get ready.

01:07:14.458 --> 01:07:16.458
If you don't come,
I'll drag you out of here.

01:07:16.541 --> 01:07:17.583
Keep quiet.

01:07:18.333 --> 01:07:19.208
Hey!

01:07:25.750 --> 01:07:27.625
Why?
Simply sit, I'll come…

01:07:35.708 --> 01:07:37.083
When should we leave?

01:07:37.625 --> 01:07:38.583
After breakfast we'll leave.

01:07:45.500 --> 01:07:46.500
Go have your bath.

01:07:51.250 --> 01:07:52.208
Go bathe!

01:07:54.458 --> 01:07:57.500
Let's visit uncle's house and meet mom,
she's been unwell for long.

01:07:57.750 --> 01:07:58.833
we will go meet her also.

01:07:59.208 --> 01:08:00.166
Okay.

01:08:14.583 --> 01:08:16.333
T.SABARI III 'A'

01:12:52.500 --> 01:12:53.375
Brother…

01:12:59.000 --> 01:13:00.000
Brother…

01:13:05.375 --> 01:13:06.333
Brother…

01:13:09.750 --> 01:13:10.833
Brother…

01:13:47.416 --> 01:13:48.333
Uncle!

01:13:49.541 --> 01:13:53.875
Baththa's lying dead in the school toilet.

01:13:55.583 --> 01:13:56.500
What?

01:13:56.875 --> 01:13:58.083
What are you saying?

01:13:58.875 --> 01:13:59.916
Hey!

01:14:00.833 --> 01:14:02.125
Come fast!

01:14:02.916 --> 01:14:05.208
It seems Baththa is lying dead inside.

01:14:05.333 --> 01:14:06.458
What are you saying?

01:14:47.958 --> 01:14:48.875
Dad.

01:14:56.708 --> 01:14:57.666
Brother, did Sabari come here?

01:14:57.750 --> 01:14:58.666
No!

01:15:18.125 --> 01:15:19.375
Move aside.

01:15:22.416 --> 01:15:23.333
Dad!

01:15:23.916 --> 01:15:24.958
Get up, dear.

01:15:25.625 --> 01:15:26.625
Dad!

01:15:27.250 --> 01:15:29.125
Dear!

01:15:29.500 --> 01:15:30.416
Dear!

01:15:33.041 --> 01:15:34.041
GENTS TOILET

01:15:36.583 --> 01:15:40.833
THE DOOR HAS OPENED

01:15:54.958 --> 01:15:55.875
It's him!

01:15:56.666 --> 01:15:57.583
It's this boy!

01:16:04.750 --> 01:16:09.041
GOVERNMENT HOSPITAL

01:16:16.458 --> 01:16:17.458
Sister!

01:16:18.625 --> 01:16:19.541
It's him!

01:16:29.583 --> 01:16:30.458
Was it you?

01:16:40.333 --> 01:16:41.541
What is your name?

01:16:41.958 --> 01:16:42.833
Sabari.

01:16:43.541 --> 01:16:44.458
You're not Sabari!

01:16:45.708 --> 01:16:46.583
You're my God!

01:16:48.125 --> 01:16:51.125
My God who I pray to,
has sent you there at the right time.

01:16:53.666 --> 01:16:55.666
If we had brought him in a little later,

01:16:57.166 --> 01:16:58.833
we couldn't have seen him alive.

01:17:01.041 --> 01:17:04.333
If the child made it there
shortly after the snakebite,

01:17:04.416 --> 01:17:06.125
it's all thanks to your goodness, Kannima.

01:17:07.583 --> 01:17:10.208
For the past eight days,
I've prayed to every God there is.

01:17:15.208 --> 01:17:16.083
Dear…

01:17:16.791 --> 01:17:17.791
why did you go there?

01:17:29.250 --> 01:17:30.833
I was playing with this toy

01:17:31.083 --> 01:17:33.500
in the exam hall.

01:17:33.750 --> 01:17:36.875
The teacher confiscated it
and kept it in the staff room.

01:17:37.208 --> 01:17:40.208
I was scared to ask the teacher for it.

01:17:41.083 --> 01:17:43.833
It had been a while since
school closed for the holidays,

01:17:44.416 --> 01:17:47.875
so I assumed no one would be there.
That's why I went to get it.

01:17:48.166 --> 01:17:50.333
While I was taking it,
I suddenly felt queasy

01:17:51.875 --> 01:17:54.500
and rushed to the toilet.

01:18:03.833 --> 01:18:06.291
Baththa was unconscious
inside the water tank.

01:18:07.333 --> 01:18:09.166
I got scared seeing that.

01:18:09.583 --> 01:18:12.791
I ran out and told the person
who was walking across.

01:18:19.916 --> 01:18:20.833
Take this.

01:18:33.875 --> 01:18:35.250
Why have you brought my son here?

01:18:37.166 --> 01:18:38.083
Sister!

01:18:38.708 --> 01:18:40.208
What is my son doing here?

01:18:43.708 --> 01:18:44.833
Is this your son, Selvi?

01:18:46.000 --> 01:18:48.708
Your son has only saved my husband,
and given him back to me.

01:18:51.041 --> 01:18:52.916
He's the one who saw him
in the school toilet,

01:18:53.000 --> 01:18:54.000
and has come informed the person outside.

01:18:55.708 --> 01:18:56.583
Hey!

01:18:57.000 --> 01:18:57.875
Why did you go there?

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:01.083
Tell me, come here.

01:19:05.333 --> 01:19:06.291
Why did you go there?

01:19:07.833 --> 01:19:08.708
Tell me.

01:19:13.666 --> 01:19:15.083
At the exam hall,

01:19:15.541 --> 01:19:17.833
I was playing with this toy,

01:19:18.333 --> 01:19:21.166
The teacher confiscated it
and kept it in the staff room.

01:19:28.000 --> 01:19:29.666
T. SABARI, III 'A'

01:19:41.708 --> 01:19:42.750
You can go inside.

01:19:43.416 --> 01:19:44.333
Come.

01:20:10.791 --> 01:20:11.666
Don't cry.

01:20:12.208 --> 01:20:13.291
The doctor said nothing is wrong.

01:20:14.208 --> 01:20:15.416
We can go home fast.

01:20:22.041 --> 01:20:24.833
I thought I will never see you again…

01:20:26.791 --> 01:20:27.916
Don't cry, Dad!

01:20:42.166 --> 01:20:43.333
How did I come out?

01:20:43.500 --> 01:20:44.958
In the school toilet,

01:20:45.708 --> 01:20:47.000
a snake had bitten you,
the venom had spread,

01:20:47.208 --> 01:20:48.333
and you had fainted inside the water tank.

01:20:49.291 --> 01:20:51.333
Just on time the God I worship,

01:20:51.958 --> 01:20:53.291
sent someone,
and saved you.

01:20:56.041 --> 01:20:56.958
Who?

01:20:58.000 --> 01:20:58.875
Come…

01:21:03.125 --> 01:21:04.041
Go…

01:21:27.083 --> 01:21:29.083
He's the one who saw you and
came and informed.

01:21:34.833 --> 01:21:35.833
How did you come there?

01:21:41.000 --> 01:21:42.250
At the exam hall,

01:21:42.500 --> 01:21:44.833
I was playing with this toy,

01:21:53.333 --> 01:21:54.583
so I went to the toilet,

01:21:54.875 --> 01:21:56.250
and as I opened the door,

01:21:56.458 --> 01:21:58.708
you were there,
fallen inside the water tank.

01:22:33.791 --> 01:22:35.375
When you came there,
did you see anyone?

01:22:40.208 --> 01:22:41.333
Did you find out who it was?

01:22:41.583 --> 01:22:42.625
We are investigating.

01:22:43.083 --> 01:22:44.083
Can we talk?

01:22:45.041 --> 01:22:46.875
The school gate was locked all the while.

01:22:47.458 --> 01:22:49.875
The key never left the President's house.

01:22:50.041 --> 01:22:51.208
The lock isn't broken as well.

01:22:51.500 --> 01:22:53.583
Then how did they take you
inside the toilet?

01:22:55.500 --> 01:22:57.208
-No one took me there, sir.
-Then?

01:22:57.333 --> 01:22:58.208
I went there on my own.

01:22:58.291 --> 01:23:00.041
Why did you go to school
at that unearthly hour?

01:23:12.666 --> 01:23:13.541
Sir,

01:23:14.166 --> 01:23:15.666
for the complaint that I was missing,
filed by my wife,

01:23:15.750 --> 01:23:16.875
have you lodged an FIR?

01:23:17.208 --> 01:23:18.375
I didn't file an FIR.

01:23:18.458 --> 01:23:19.541
First I thought it's better to search…

01:23:19.625 --> 01:23:20.916
So you have not registered the complaint?

01:23:21.708 --> 01:23:23.250
Only if you register one, can you
investigate, sir.

01:23:23.708 --> 01:23:24.833
Drop this,I will take care.

01:23:24.916 --> 01:23:25.791
Really?

01:23:25.875 --> 01:23:26.750
Shall I drop it?

01:23:28.166 --> 01:23:29.041
Look here,

01:23:29.125 --> 01:23:30.583
your husband says he doesn't want,
to file a case.

01:23:30.791 --> 01:23:32.958
If anything happens again,
you shouldn't come to us.

01:23:33.083 --> 01:23:34.000
Understand?

01:23:36.916 --> 01:23:37.875
This boy?

01:23:38.041 --> 01:23:40.041
He's the one who saw him inside
the school toilet,

01:23:40.125 --> 01:23:41.041
and informed someone outside.

01:23:41.291 --> 01:23:42.500
Why did you go there?

01:23:45.333 --> 01:23:46.333
You wait, Sabari.

01:23:46.416 --> 01:23:47.791
Poor thing how many times
will he repeat it.

01:23:47.875 --> 01:23:48.750
I'll tell you.

01:23:49.916 --> 01:23:50.833
During the exams,

01:23:50.916 --> 01:23:52.625
he was playing with this toy,

01:23:52.708 --> 01:23:53.583
poor thing.

01:23:53.666 --> 01:23:55.875
The teacher confiscated it and kept it in
the staff room.

01:23:57.208 --> 01:23:59.541
Just while we are leaving to our hometown,
what is this confusion, Selvi?

01:23:59.625 --> 01:24:00.541
What confusion!

01:24:01.125 --> 01:24:03.458
Kannima got Baththa back alive.

01:24:03.833 --> 01:24:04.708
That too,

01:24:04.791 --> 01:24:06.583
because of our Sabari,
is a happy thing, right?

01:24:08.791 --> 01:24:10.333
When he went to retrieve it,

01:24:10.500 --> 01:24:11.583
just at the right time,

01:24:12.166 --> 01:24:13.416
his stomach felt queasy.

01:24:18.875 --> 01:24:21.125
A small boy has said why he went,

01:24:21.250 --> 01:24:22.333
but you are not.

01:24:23.625 --> 01:24:24.625
I'll take leave.

01:24:25.541 --> 01:24:26.416
Let's go.

01:24:27.916 --> 01:24:29.291
Why did you go there?

01:24:29.916 --> 01:24:31.666
Who locked you inside?

01:24:32.000 --> 01:24:32.875
I don't know.

01:24:32.958 --> 01:24:34.291
Okay, why did you go there?

01:24:40.791 --> 01:24:41.708
Delhi…

01:24:41.833 --> 01:24:42.708
Brother…

01:24:45.791 --> 01:24:47.125
When the time is right,
I'll tell you.

01:24:48.250 --> 01:24:49.208
Okay, Brother…

01:24:53.750 --> 01:24:55.583
Why did you tell the police not
to file a case?

01:24:58.083 --> 01:24:59.666
The police shouldn't catch him.

01:25:03.250 --> 01:25:04.291
I want him.

01:25:11.625 --> 01:25:13.333
Anyways, inform Baththa's family,

01:25:13.416 --> 01:25:16.166
till the inspector comes back, that they
shouldn't go out of station.

01:25:16.250 --> 01:25:17.125
Okay, sir…

01:25:17.958 --> 01:25:21.083
And also the same thing to the small boy
who saw him first.

01:25:21.166 --> 01:25:22.083
Okay, sir.

01:25:30.958 --> 01:25:32.125
We'll leave?

01:25:32.833 --> 01:25:33.791
Okay, selvi.

01:25:34.208 --> 01:25:35.083
I'll leave.

01:25:35.375 --> 01:25:36.250
Okay…

01:25:37.041 --> 01:25:37.958
Sabari.

01:25:38.083 --> 01:25:38.958
Come here.

01:25:41.291 --> 01:25:42.208
Dear,

01:25:42.375 --> 01:25:44.166
hereafter we are no longer strangers.

01:25:44.916 --> 01:25:45.875
You're our son.

01:25:47.541 --> 01:25:48.458
Mother…

01:25:48.541 --> 01:25:49.416
Father…

01:25:49.500 --> 01:25:50.458
Sister…

01:25:50.708 --> 01:25:51.750
Understand?

01:25:52.166 --> 01:25:53.500
Hereafter,
we are all there for you.

01:25:53.625 --> 01:25:54.541
Okay.

01:25:56.375 --> 01:25:57.375
What?

01:25:59.291 --> 01:26:00.250
Okay, go.

01:26:01.666 --> 01:26:02.541
I'll take leave.

01:26:02.833 --> 01:26:03.750
Brother…

01:26:03.916 --> 01:26:04.958
Do come home often.

01:26:05.041 --> 01:26:05.916
Sure.

01:26:09.500 --> 01:26:10.458
Okay, sit.

01:26:32.958 --> 01:26:33.833
What?

01:26:34.333 --> 01:26:35.458
Is the Chutney hot?

01:26:38.083 --> 01:26:39.166
It is superb!

01:27:14.333 --> 01:27:16.250
What did they give you to eat in there?

01:27:20.666 --> 01:27:21.541
Tell…

01:27:28.916 --> 01:27:29.833
Rusk…

01:27:32.833 --> 01:27:34.625
For 8 days you ate only rusk?

01:27:40.708 --> 01:27:42.333
Bloody heartless scoundrels.

01:27:43.166 --> 01:27:45.416
8 days they gave you just rusk!

01:27:47.541 --> 01:27:49.458
If I ever get hold of him!

01:27:50.208 --> 01:27:51.083
Sister,

01:27:51.333 --> 01:27:52.916
I'll find out who it is,

01:27:53.041 --> 01:27:54.916
and see how I wreck him!

01:27:55.041 --> 01:27:57.166
What guts,
for him to do this to our brother!

01:27:58.250 --> 01:27:59.125
Sabari,

01:27:59.375 --> 01:28:00.291
don't be scared,

01:28:00.458 --> 01:28:01.333
come inside.

01:28:04.208 --> 01:28:05.083
What is it, dear?

01:28:08.500 --> 01:28:09.375
Here.

01:29:08.833 --> 01:29:09.708
Brother,

01:29:11.875 --> 01:29:13.583
before you had come out from the hospital,

01:29:13.708 --> 01:29:15.958
I wanted to find out
who did this to you,

01:29:16.208 --> 01:29:17.083
but I couldn't.

01:29:17.250 --> 01:29:18.208
As far as I know,

01:29:18.541 --> 01:29:21.041
Definitely they have hired someone,
from outside and carried out this.

01:29:22.291 --> 01:29:23.166
Brother,

01:29:23.375 --> 01:29:25.000
If we know why you went in there,

01:29:25.250 --> 01:29:27.916
it will be easier to take a guess as to
who followed you.

01:29:28.000 --> 01:29:29.291
Then the culprit will be easily caught!

01:29:35.791 --> 01:29:36.958
There is no connection between the two.

01:29:39.625 --> 01:29:40.500
Kannima,

01:29:40.833 --> 01:29:41.750
get the invitation.

01:29:42.791 --> 01:29:43.666
Why?

01:29:43.875 --> 01:29:45.708
Let's write down the names of the invitees
for the function.

01:29:46.041 --> 01:29:47.541
-Are we going to have the function?
-Yes…

01:29:47.750 --> 01:29:48.791
Let's not change it.

01:29:48.916 --> 01:29:49.916
We will have it on the fixed date itself.

01:29:50.208 --> 01:29:51.083
Why?

01:29:51.625 --> 01:29:53.541
Let your health get better.
We can do it after that.

01:29:57.083 --> 01:29:58.166
Nothing is wrong with me.

01:29:58.708 --> 01:30:00.750
The minute I saw you and Thenu,

01:30:01.208 --> 01:30:02.208
everything was fine.

01:30:04.541 --> 01:30:06.041
We have ten days left.

01:30:06.291 --> 01:30:08.000
Just wait and see, by then…

01:30:08.833 --> 01:30:09.708
Thenu…

01:30:10.083 --> 01:30:10.958
Dad…

01:30:11.791 --> 01:30:13.875
Write down all the names he
calls out, on this.

01:30:15.375 --> 01:30:16.666
Okay dad, I'll get the pen.

01:30:16.791 --> 01:30:17.666
Come…

01:30:18.541 --> 01:30:20.416
All those whom you suspect,

01:30:20.500 --> 01:30:21.583
give the names one by one.

01:30:21.791 --> 01:30:22.666
Why, brother?

01:30:22.750 --> 01:30:24.250
Are you going to invite all of them?

01:30:27.041 --> 01:30:28.125
Why, brother?

01:30:28.666 --> 01:30:30.458
When we see them face
to face whilst inviting,

01:30:30.541 --> 01:30:31.625
we will know who did it.

01:30:31.708 --> 01:30:32.625
If we don't?

01:30:33.125 --> 01:30:34.500
Then, let them come for the function.

01:30:35.333 --> 01:30:37.375
After all a function is for everyone
to get together.

01:30:37.583 --> 01:30:38.500
What are you saying?

01:30:39.000 --> 01:30:41.166
Are you saying,to let go of the guy
who did this to you?

01:30:45.958 --> 01:30:47.000
Nothing…

01:30:48.541 --> 01:30:49.500
Nothing, baby…

01:30:52.166 --> 01:30:53.250
How is that possible?

01:30:55.250 --> 01:30:56.666
First let's find out who did it.

01:30:58.833 --> 01:31:00.458
This is what I expected?

01:31:01.000 --> 01:31:02.083
You go and give the invitations.

01:31:02.583 --> 01:31:03.833
But before the function,

01:31:04.000 --> 01:31:05.666
I will find out who it was.

01:31:08.916 --> 01:31:09.791
Brother?

01:31:10.208 --> 01:31:11.166
The shop?

01:31:11.583 --> 01:31:13.250
The shop's been locked for
the past 10 days.

01:31:13.583 --> 01:31:14.541
Let it be like that.

01:31:15.541 --> 01:31:17.083
There is a function at home,
let's get the work going.

01:31:18.791 --> 01:31:20.125
First we have to whitewash the whole
house.

01:31:20.625 --> 01:31:21.541
Is it not Kannima?

01:31:24.583 --> 01:31:25.458
Ask Gopi to come.

01:31:25.541 --> 01:31:26.416
Okay.

01:31:26.541 --> 01:31:27.791
Order the fairy lights and the mike
equipment.

01:31:27.916 --> 01:31:28.833
Okay.

01:31:49.583 --> 01:31:52.958
Come outside
Look at the world

01:31:53.041 --> 01:31:56.000
Your world shall change!

01:31:56.125 --> 01:31:59.291
Across the entire sky
You shall fly

01:31:59.375 --> 01:32:02.041
Come you old bird

01:32:02.333 --> 01:32:04.791
On your lips

01:32:04.875 --> 01:32:08.208
The laughter
Wonder who sowed that?

01:32:08.375 --> 01:32:10.541
It's surprising your eyes

01:32:10.625 --> 01:32:13.500
Are brimming with tears

01:32:15.291 --> 01:32:17.958
Long long ago…

01:32:18.375 --> 01:32:21.416
When thee was innocent

01:32:21.500 --> 01:32:24.375
All that moved you then

01:32:24.833 --> 01:32:28.041
Is it melting in your heart now?

01:32:28.166 --> 01:32:30.750
There was unlimited rambling

01:32:30.833 --> 01:32:33.916
There was unlimited ruckus

01:32:34.000 --> 01:32:37.000
After witnessing a lot within…

01:32:37.125 --> 01:32:40.625
You came and stood
In silence?!

01:32:40.833 --> 01:32:43.291
Is the universe cradling you?

01:32:43.583 --> 01:32:46.875
Is your heart complimenting you?

01:32:47.166 --> 01:32:50.291
Is happiness washing over you?

01:32:50.458 --> 01:32:53.125
Are tears welling up?

01:32:53.583 --> 01:32:55.250
Within you, deep down…

01:32:55.333 --> 01:32:59.250
Are the doors opening?

01:32:59.875 --> 01:33:01.708
Without any rhyme or reason…

01:33:01.791 --> 01:33:05.250
Is your soul sensing sweetness?

01:33:06.416 --> 01:33:08.166
Your wife…

01:33:08.250 --> 01:33:09.708
Your child

01:33:09.791 --> 01:33:11.291
Their blooming faces

01:33:11.375 --> 01:33:12.875
You must see…

01:33:12.958 --> 01:33:14.500
You Laugh…

01:33:14.583 --> 01:33:16.125
You go and embrace…

01:33:16.208 --> 01:33:18.875
The fire within shall be doused

01:33:19.125 --> 01:33:21.583
Towards your darkness…

01:33:21.666 --> 01:33:25.083
The Ligh…
Was showered by whom?

01:33:25.166 --> 01:33:30.083
Are your legs walking towards
an endless dawn?!

01:33:31.041 --> 01:33:33.958
Has the angst…

01:33:34.041 --> 01:33:36.875
eased?

01:33:37.333 --> 01:33:39.541
Like a peacock's feather…

01:33:39.625 --> 01:33:43.791
Are the thoughts… floating?

01:33:43.875 --> 01:33:45.625
Within you…

01:33:45.708 --> 01:33:49.791
Is a small child being born?

01:33:50.500 --> 01:33:52.166
Is Kindness…

01:33:52.291 --> 01:33:53.791
What your family…

01:33:53.875 --> 01:33:56.750
Emanates?

01:34:02.125 --> 01:34:03.041
You got scared?

01:34:07.041 --> 01:34:07.916
Me too.

01:34:09.833 --> 01:34:11.000
I got very scared.

01:34:15.291 --> 01:34:17.125
I thought it was all over.

01:34:18.875 --> 01:34:20.500
I feel I've been reborn.

01:34:25.208 --> 01:34:29.041
I was yearning badly to see you and our
daughter again.

01:34:30.500 --> 01:34:32.250
I prayed to
every God to save me.

01:34:35.250 --> 01:34:36.875
The song they played at the
Goddess Amman Temple,

01:34:36.958 --> 01:34:38.541
The Azaan five times from the Mosque,

01:34:38.625 --> 01:34:39.666
The Church's bell,

01:34:40.541 --> 01:34:41.833
I heard all of it everyday.

01:34:42.500 --> 01:34:44.000
I screamed like crazy, you know!

01:34:45.666 --> 01:34:47.541
I doubt anyone heard it.

01:35:00.750 --> 01:35:02.083
The value of everything is understood,

01:35:03.625 --> 01:35:05.458
only when the end is near.

01:35:13.833 --> 01:35:15.250
I have troubled you a lot.

01:35:17.583 --> 01:35:19.166
-Forgive me Kannima.
-No!

01:35:19.875 --> 01:35:20.875
Not at all.

01:35:22.458 --> 01:35:23.583
Forgive me.

01:35:28.166 --> 01:35:29.875
If that kid did not come,
imagine my plight.

01:35:31.000 --> 01:35:32.125
Why you thinking of all that.

01:35:49.333 --> 01:35:51.375
Why did you got to school at that
unearthly hour?

01:36:03.083 --> 01:36:03.958
Kanni…

01:36:04.541 --> 01:36:05.416
Hey!

01:36:05.708 --> 01:36:06.958
They just bought rusk and left.

01:36:09.041 --> 01:36:10.541
-He bought it today also?
-Yes.

01:36:10.750 --> 01:36:11.708
Which way did they go?

01:36:12.041 --> 01:36:12.916
That way…

01:36:13.000 --> 01:36:13.875
Blue color shirt.

01:36:16.333 --> 01:36:17.500
Eat…

01:36:21.791 --> 01:36:22.666
Hey!

01:36:22.916 --> 01:36:24.250
Did anyone else buy?

01:36:24.625 --> 01:36:25.833
Think carefully.

01:36:28.750 --> 01:36:30.416
No one like you're suspecting,

01:36:30.625 --> 01:36:32.000
just small boys buy it and go.

01:36:34.125 --> 01:36:35.666
Can you identify who those boys are?

01:36:38.416 --> 01:36:40.083
I don't know who those boys are.

01:36:40.833 --> 01:36:41.791
But if I see them, I can identify!

01:36:43.291 --> 01:36:45.083
If you see those boys again,

01:36:45.250 --> 01:36:47.583
hold them here,
and send word to Baththa's house.

01:36:47.666 --> 01:36:48.625
Okay.

01:36:54.750 --> 01:36:55.833
The coconut looks too matured.

01:36:55.916 --> 01:36:56.833
Take whatever you want and leave.

01:36:56.916 --> 01:36:57.791
Ma'am,

01:36:57.875 --> 01:36:59.333
would you know where Sabari's house is?

01:36:59.416 --> 01:37:00.708
Are you asking selvi's home?

01:37:00.916 --> 01:37:01.833
Yes, sister.

01:37:01.916 --> 01:37:04.041
Just go inside, upstairs and the first
house on the right.

01:37:05.875 --> 01:37:07.541
-Okay…
-Hey! That's Baththa!

01:37:14.250 --> 01:37:15.208
Selvi.

01:37:15.958 --> 01:37:16.958
Hey! Go see who it is.

01:37:21.916 --> 01:37:22.875
Please come.

01:37:23.625 --> 01:37:24.500
Selvi.

01:37:24.875 --> 01:37:25.750
Hey, Sabari.

01:37:25.833 --> 01:37:26.833
Please come, brother and sister.

01:37:26.916 --> 01:37:28.166
Come Thenu…
Please sit.

01:37:28.333 --> 01:37:29.916
No, no, you relax.
Hey, Sabari.

01:37:30.000 --> 01:37:31.166
Where you going. Come here.

01:37:31.500 --> 01:37:32.708
Come… come… please sit.

01:37:33.875 --> 01:37:34.875
Come. Come.

01:37:38.125 --> 01:37:39.625
-I'll get some water.
-How are you?

01:37:40.958 --> 01:37:41.833
Yeah, sure.

01:37:41.916 --> 01:37:42.791
Are you fine?

01:37:44.666 --> 01:37:45.666
How are you? You fine?

01:37:45.750 --> 01:37:46.875
-We are fine.
-Are you all fine?

01:37:56.125 --> 01:37:57.166
Is it dried fish gravy?

01:37:58.833 --> 01:38:00.458
The aroma is mesmerizing.

01:38:01.291 --> 01:38:03.500
Always behaving like a police dog,
sniffing around.

01:38:03.833 --> 01:38:04.708
Hey…

01:38:04.791 --> 01:38:06.208
What is this, you've called me a dog!

01:38:06.416 --> 01:38:07.416
Question her baby,
question her.

01:38:07.583 --> 01:38:09.208
Yesterday's cooking,
is it still smelling?

01:38:09.541 --> 01:38:10.416
Yes.

01:38:10.500 --> 01:38:12.166
Your brother,
can be spot on about the smell,

01:38:12.250 --> 01:38:13.791
of what was cooked even three days ago.

01:38:15.833 --> 01:38:18.625
From your odor I will figure out
who you are.

01:38:23.125 --> 01:38:25.083
Do come another day,
you can have a good meal.

01:38:25.375 --> 01:38:26.291
Okay.

01:38:28.416 --> 01:38:30.041
We are having
Thenu's puberty function,

01:38:30.333 --> 01:38:31.708
so we came to give you the invitation.

01:38:32.208 --> 01:38:34.041
Give me a notebook to write in. Hold this.

01:38:37.791 --> 01:38:38.666
T.SABARI

01:38:38.750 --> 01:38:39.666
T. Sabari,

01:38:39.750 --> 01:38:40.916
section lll 'A'.

01:38:41.583 --> 01:38:42.833
You're studying in the 3rd
standard, is it?

01:38:42.958 --> 01:38:44.375
You're such a big man, is it?

01:38:45.333 --> 01:38:46.625
What's your name, sir?

01:38:48.125 --> 01:38:49.166
Thirunavukarasu.

01:38:52.791 --> 01:38:54.666
Thiru - na - vu - karasu.

01:38:56.958 --> 01:38:57.833
T. Sabari,

01:38:58.708 --> 01:38:59.750
here, your notebook.

01:39:00.750 --> 01:39:01.708
Get up.

01:39:03.916 --> 01:39:04.916
Here you go.

01:39:05.333 --> 01:39:06.500
You must come.

01:39:06.625 --> 01:39:07.958
The first invitation is for you.

01:39:08.041 --> 01:39:09.041
After this only for the rest.

01:39:10.500 --> 01:39:12.250
Sabari is the reason,
why the function is happening.

01:39:13.541 --> 01:39:15.041
Kannima…
Give the ‘Kumkum'.

01:39:25.625 --> 01:39:26.750
We are going to the clothes shop,

01:39:26.833 --> 01:39:28.500
we wanted to know,
if we can take Sabari along.

01:39:28.625 --> 01:39:30.333
Why do you want to take him also,

01:39:30.416 --> 01:39:31.375
not necessary, it's alright.

01:39:31.875 --> 01:39:33.041
We are going by car.

01:39:33.708 --> 01:39:35.208
You come Sabari.
Shall we go?

01:39:35.333 --> 01:39:36.375
What do you say?

01:39:36.875 --> 01:39:37.791
Okay.

01:39:38.000 --> 01:39:39.333
What? Will you go?

01:39:40.416 --> 01:39:42.083
If I say no,
like you're going to listen.

01:39:42.666 --> 01:39:45.000
That too they have mentioned the car,
go and change your shirt.

01:39:45.500 --> 01:39:46.500
Go.

01:39:48.125 --> 01:39:49.333
Dress smartly and come,
let's go.

01:40:14.250 --> 01:40:15.250
Hey! Sabari,

01:40:16.083 --> 01:40:17.291
is it ‘Gokul Sandal'
Talcum powder?

01:40:18.458 --> 01:40:19.916
The fragrance is mesmerizing.

01:40:31.875 --> 01:40:33.375
-See you, friend! Say bye…
-Okay.

01:40:33.541 --> 01:40:34.416
Bye.

01:40:34.500 --> 01:40:35.375
Bye.

01:40:46.833 --> 01:40:50.541
O ! Trusted you to be a brother!

01:40:50.625 --> 01:40:53.291
And he nurtured you

01:40:53.500 --> 01:40:55.708
As a Mother and As a Father

01:40:55.791 --> 01:40:57.583
He believed he was!

01:40:57.708 --> 01:40:59.208
This is nice. You like it?

01:40:59.291 --> 01:41:00.333
Kannima,

01:41:00.833 --> 01:41:02.250
I seem to like it all.

01:41:02.500 --> 01:41:03.375
Yes.

01:41:03.458 --> 01:41:04.541
We saw another one,
in parrot green.

01:41:04.750 --> 01:41:06.166
This is nice,
parrot green.

01:41:06.250 --> 01:41:07.250
This is beautiful,
right?

01:41:08.541 --> 01:41:09.833
-It looks beautiful.
-It's superb, baby.

01:41:14.250 --> 01:41:15.333
It's so expensive.

01:41:15.500 --> 01:41:16.458
So what?

01:41:17.208 --> 01:41:18.708
It's what my daughter is going to drape
for the first time.

01:41:18.791 --> 01:41:19.916
Thenu, you like it right?

01:41:20.708 --> 01:41:22.541
It's nice,
but mum's saying…

01:41:22.666 --> 01:41:23.708
Forget about your mum.

01:41:23.791 --> 01:41:24.750
You like it, right?

01:41:25.166 --> 01:41:26.500
-Hmmm…
-Then what,

01:41:26.625 --> 01:41:27.500
take it.

01:41:28.375 --> 01:41:29.458
Is it nice, Sabari?

01:41:29.666 --> 01:41:30.625
Is it nice?

01:41:32.000 --> 01:41:33.583
Shall we go up and buy clothes?

01:41:36.166 --> 01:41:37.416
Which one do you want, Sabari?

01:41:41.000 --> 01:41:41.875
Do you have a Safari suit?

01:41:41.958 --> 01:41:43.000
-Yes sir.
-Take it out.

01:41:51.500 --> 01:41:52.375
Wow!

01:41:52.666 --> 01:41:53.541
Sabari!

01:41:54.166 --> 01:41:55.041
Safari!

01:41:55.125 --> 01:41:56.000
How's it?

01:41:56.083 --> 01:41:57.166
It's in sync, right?

01:41:59.333 --> 01:42:00.208
-Pack this.
-Okay.

01:42:00.291 --> 01:42:01.333
What else do you want?

01:42:01.583 --> 01:42:02.708
Nothing. Enough.

01:42:04.166 --> 01:42:05.500
You shouldn't say that Sabari.

01:42:05.750 --> 01:42:06.708
Take more.

01:42:07.125 --> 01:42:09.833
At your age I used to yearn
to wear new clothes.

01:42:10.083 --> 01:42:11.541
Even for festivals like Diwali and Pongal
I never got.

01:42:12.375 --> 01:42:13.958
I used to love the Policeman's costume.

01:42:14.625 --> 01:42:16.958
To buy that,
I slowly collected money,

01:42:17.125 --> 01:42:18.958
By the time I got the whole
amount, I grew up.

01:42:27.208 --> 01:42:28.125
Awesome!

01:42:28.500 --> 01:42:29.916
Shake hands!
SP Chaudhary,

01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:31.000
I'm under arrest!

01:42:34.583 --> 01:42:36.291
-Do you have Rajiv Gandhi's costume.
-We have, sir.

01:42:36.583 --> 01:42:37.458
Take it out.

01:42:39.250 --> 01:42:40.458
Wow! Simply stunning!

01:42:41.250 --> 01:42:42.375
Simply fantastic it is.

01:42:43.250 --> 01:42:44.375
Did you like it, Sabari?

01:42:47.958 --> 01:42:48.833
Hey,

01:42:48.916 --> 01:42:49.916
you didn't serve crabs for him?

01:42:50.958 --> 01:42:52.041
How will he be able to break and eat it.

01:42:52.125 --> 01:42:53.583
-I'll do it for him.
-When?

01:42:55.833 --> 01:42:56.791
Open your mouth.

01:43:00.958 --> 01:43:01.833
Eat.

01:43:01.916 --> 01:43:03.000
Hey, Baththa…

01:43:06.458 --> 01:43:07.708
Hey, it's me Aasai.

01:43:10.333 --> 01:43:11.833
-You, is it…
-Sit… sit…

01:43:13.625 --> 01:43:14.500
Sit…

01:43:18.166 --> 01:43:19.333
Have you found out who it was?

01:43:20.666 --> 01:43:21.541
No.

01:43:21.916 --> 01:43:23.000
Don't let it slide Baththa.

01:43:23.250 --> 01:43:26.166
Sometimes it could be someone
whom we know very well.

01:43:26.375 --> 01:43:28.375
You're good at sniffing out people, right?

01:43:29.500 --> 01:43:31.625
Nowadays these small fries who sprouted
yesterday,

01:43:31.708 --> 01:43:32.708
are creating havoc.

01:43:33.125 --> 01:43:34.791
If you suspect anyone, tell me.

01:43:35.166 --> 01:43:37.291
I will find out just by his facial
expressions,

01:43:37.791 --> 01:43:38.875
if he's the one who did it.

01:43:39.416 --> 01:43:40.291
Because…

01:43:40.375 --> 01:43:41.958
I have that kinda super power.

01:43:42.625 --> 01:43:44.250
If you need any help,

01:43:44.416 --> 01:43:45.291
let me know, I'll come.

01:43:54.083 --> 01:43:55.208
Your children?

01:43:55.625 --> 01:43:56.500
Hmmm…

01:43:56.916 --> 01:44:00.250
Your son looks just like you.

01:44:01.166 --> 01:44:02.708
Your power is so effective.

01:44:03.083 --> 01:44:04.208
If you find out, let me know.

01:44:04.583 --> 01:44:05.791
Won't I do it for you.

01:44:06.166 --> 01:44:07.291
-See you, sister.
-Yes.

01:44:18.625 --> 01:44:19.541
Water… water…

01:44:32.125 --> 01:44:34.458
Delhi said we can find out
through the rusk.

01:44:38.791 --> 01:44:40.291
They've inquired in all the shops
within the area.

01:44:41.791 --> 01:44:43.333
Few boys have come and bought everyday.

01:44:44.291 --> 01:44:45.166
Who are they?

01:44:45.500 --> 01:44:46.500
Whose children?

01:44:47.875 --> 01:44:48.875
We will know soon.

01:45:15.375 --> 01:45:16.416
None of them.

01:45:18.625 --> 01:45:21.291
All the 8 days that Baththa was inside,
did that boy come?

01:45:21.625 --> 01:45:23.541
Everyday he will be there without fail in
the morning.

01:45:24.708 --> 01:45:26.958
Did he come after Baththa was found?

01:45:27.791 --> 01:45:29.666
After Baththa was found…

01:45:30.291 --> 01:45:31.166
He didn't come.

01:45:31.250 --> 01:45:32.708
Then for sure it's that boy.

01:45:33.250 --> 01:45:35.750
If we catch him,
we will get to know who did it.

01:45:35.916 --> 01:45:39.041
Has asked a child to buy it. Pansy prick!

01:45:56.750 --> 01:45:57.708
Come, brother.

01:45:58.208 --> 01:45:59.583
Come Kannima.
How are you?

01:45:59.666 --> 01:46:01.791
-I am fine. You?
-I am fine.

01:46:02.250 --> 01:46:03.708
Sit. Please sit.

01:46:16.541 --> 01:46:17.541
Here.

01:46:21.916 --> 01:46:23.458
I am having a puberty function
for my daughter.

01:46:24.291 --> 01:46:25.750
Please forget the past,

01:46:26.375 --> 01:46:28.125
come with the family,
and bless my daughter.

01:46:29.083 --> 01:46:30.166
You must come.

01:46:33.708 --> 01:46:34.916
What is this…

01:46:35.833 --> 01:46:38.000
I know Thenu from when she was born.

01:46:38.083 --> 01:46:40.125
It seems like now that I saw
her as a baby.

01:46:40.958 --> 01:46:42.958
And you're telling me she's
attained puberty.

01:46:45.875 --> 01:46:48.500
In between so much has happened.

01:46:49.000 --> 01:46:50.000
Why are you talking about that.

01:46:50.916 --> 01:46:51.958
Why are you talking about that.

01:46:53.250 --> 01:46:55.375
This is a function in our house.

01:46:55.458 --> 01:46:56.375
We will rock it.

01:46:58.000 --> 01:46:59.000
-Sit down, Baththa.
-Sit down.

01:46:59.125 --> 01:47:00.958
-Lachamma, get them coffee.
-Okay.

01:47:01.041 --> 01:47:01.958
No, no…
we don't want.

01:47:02.083 --> 01:47:04.458
He will say that, you go bring the coffee.

01:47:08.541 --> 01:47:11.791
But you know about me, Baththa.

01:47:12.791 --> 01:47:15.041
You've come all the way to my house,
and are inviting me.

01:47:15.166 --> 01:47:17.000
But your men,

01:47:17.250 --> 01:47:21.583
are suspecting me,
and doing unwanted stuff.

01:47:23.833 --> 01:47:26.375
It's not that
I am not angry with you.

01:47:27.291 --> 01:47:29.708
Bloody bugger, to keep you in the
bathroom,

01:47:29.791 --> 01:47:32.000
play, like children?

01:47:33.333 --> 01:47:35.541
Why are you going on talking
about the past?

01:47:36.375 --> 01:47:37.291
Shut up!

01:47:39.666 --> 01:47:40.708
Forgive me.

01:47:42.083 --> 01:47:43.208
Have some sweet, Baththa.

01:47:45.041 --> 01:47:46.708
A miniscule anchor

01:47:46.791 --> 01:47:48.208
Cause it does its job

01:47:48.291 --> 01:47:49.416
A ship doesn't sail

01:47:49.500 --> 01:47:51.083
Anything I touch erupts victoriously

01:47:51.208 --> 01:47:53.708
But this one I'm unable to unravel

01:47:54.833 --> 01:47:56.041
On the coming 18th I am having,

01:47:56.166 --> 01:47:57.583
my daughter's puberty function.

01:47:58.208 --> 01:47:59.208
Please come with the family.

01:48:00.958 --> 01:48:02.291
Take the fruits and give the plate.

01:48:03.875 --> 01:48:05.083
18th I am having the function,

01:48:05.375 --> 01:48:06.333
do come with your family.

01:48:12.875 --> 01:48:14.291
I am having my daughter's puberty
function,

01:48:14.958 --> 01:48:16.000
the coming 18th.

01:48:16.375 --> 01:48:17.375
Come and take part.

01:48:24.291 --> 01:48:25.166
You don't want the fruits?

01:48:30.250 --> 01:48:31.333
What are you thinking?

01:48:33.458 --> 01:48:34.750
They didn't do it.
It's someone else.

01:48:37.000 --> 01:48:37.875
How do you know?

01:48:38.958 --> 01:48:40.541
If it were them, they wouldn't have kept
me for 8 days.

01:48:40.625 --> 01:48:42.041
The minute they locked me, they would have
finished me.

01:48:43.000 --> 01:48:46.083
If he has locked me for 8 days and given
me just rusk,

01:48:46.500 --> 01:48:48.875
he has had another plan.
Which just about failed.

01:48:50.041 --> 01:48:51.458
He's not a normal guy like these…

01:48:51.583 --> 01:48:52.541
He's a very dangerous fellow.

01:48:54.916 --> 01:48:57.083
The fragile heart, suspects whom?

01:48:57.166 --> 01:48:59.250
The one I fed milk and nurtured, is
kicking my bosom

01:48:59.333 --> 01:49:01.541
I've lost the key and am searching for
the lock

01:49:01.625 --> 01:49:04.000
The traitor should be destroyed along
with his tribe

01:49:04.125 --> 01:49:06.041
No clue as to what the issue is…

01:49:06.166 --> 01:49:08.291
This is like hide n seek,
catch the right guy

01:49:08.375 --> 01:49:10.166
All this drama for this one guy
You being a nobody have

01:49:10.250 --> 01:49:12.458
Put your hands inside
The King Cobra 's anthill

01:49:12.583 --> 01:49:14.375
The way I am gonna punch you
Blood will ooze from your mouth

01:49:14.458 --> 01:49:17.000
The game is almost over
We gonna find you

01:49:17.083 --> 01:49:18.208
You search and you hide

01:49:18.291 --> 01:49:20.125
You run and you disappear
Holding your breath

01:49:20.208 --> 01:49:21.416
You suffer as you are at the very edge!

01:49:21.500 --> 01:49:23.333
If you get caught with the
perfect proof

01:49:23.416 --> 01:49:25.666
In the basement you will be
thrown into

01:49:25.750 --> 01:49:26.916
Let any problem arise

01:49:27.208 --> 01:49:29.916
Like a lonely tree

01:49:30.000 --> 01:49:32.000
You should stand alone

01:49:32.083 --> 01:49:33.791
You shouldn't runaway in fear

01:49:33.875 --> 01:49:35.875
I am seething with anger

01:49:35.958 --> 01:49:38.541
If you get caught
You're finished!

01:49:38.666 --> 01:49:40.375
In fury
Furiously

01:49:40.458 --> 01:49:42.833
It's at its peak

01:49:42.916 --> 01:49:47.125
A King in his hunger goes
hunting for a rat

01:49:47.208 --> 01:49:49.416
If he finds you now

01:49:49.500 --> 01:49:51.416
-You are finished.
-Hey, Sabari!

01:49:51.541 --> 01:49:55.750
A King in his hunger goes
hunting for a rat

01:49:55.833 --> 01:49:58.000
If he finds you now

01:49:58.083 --> 01:49:59.583
You are finished.

01:49:59.666 --> 01:50:00.791
Sabari…

01:50:13.291 --> 01:50:14.166
Come…

01:50:24.791 --> 01:50:25.666
Hey!

01:50:26.250 --> 01:50:27.166
Come…

01:50:27.875 --> 01:50:30.541
Thenu, wants to go watch a film.
Will you come?

01:50:34.708 --> 01:50:35.625
What is it?

01:50:36.125 --> 01:50:37.541
Why do you always look frightened?

01:50:37.958 --> 01:50:38.958
Any problem?

01:50:40.791 --> 01:50:41.666
No?

01:50:43.208 --> 01:50:44.416
Anything tell me, okay.

01:50:44.958 --> 01:50:45.833
I'm there.

01:50:48.291 --> 01:50:49.666
What? What are you guys
doing here?

01:50:49.750 --> 01:50:51.333
We are looking for the boy
who bought rusk.

01:50:51.666 --> 01:50:53.125
You're still looking for the boy who
bought rusk?

01:50:53.208 --> 01:50:54.083
Yes.

01:50:57.125 --> 01:50:58.000
Brother…

01:51:03.416 --> 01:51:04.500
Brother, come here.

01:51:19.458 --> 01:51:20.583
-Hello, Brother.
-Hello.

01:51:26.166 --> 01:51:27.208
Sabari.

01:51:27.625 --> 01:51:29.041
Come let's go tell your mother.

01:51:29.416 --> 01:51:30.458
-Okay.
-Okay.

01:51:30.583 --> 01:51:31.625
Come…

01:51:34.083 --> 01:51:36.750
As though they'll let that boy roam free
around town?

01:51:37.416 --> 01:51:39.791
Won't they know if we find him,
we'll find them.

01:51:39.875 --> 01:51:41.000
-That's right…
-Yes, it seems!

01:51:41.708 --> 01:51:43.791
-You go, do your work.
-Okay.

01:52:21.416 --> 01:52:24.583
Ma… ma… ma…

01:52:24.916 --> 01:52:25.791
Wait.

01:52:27.625 --> 01:52:28.583
Come in, Sister.

01:52:30.166 --> 01:52:31.083
Dad!

01:52:31.750 --> 01:52:32.750
What happened dad?

01:52:43.458 --> 01:52:44.458
What happened?

01:52:47.666 --> 01:52:48.750
I am asking you,
what happened?

01:52:49.791 --> 01:52:51.166
Nothing, brother.
I fell down.

01:52:52.083 --> 01:52:53.416
-Fell down?
-Yes.

01:52:59.750 --> 01:53:00.833
Tell the truth.
What happened?

01:53:02.416 --> 01:53:03.791
-He's asking you, right.
-Tell him.

01:53:03.916 --> 01:53:04.875
Selvi…

01:53:07.833 --> 01:53:08.750
You tell me.

01:53:09.958 --> 01:53:11.583
At work one rogue has hit him.

01:53:12.833 --> 01:53:14.750
He is always bullying him.

01:53:15.875 --> 01:53:18.041
Today cause it was unbearable,
he retaliated.

01:53:19.291 --> 01:53:20.958
So that guy kicked up a fight,
and beat him up badly.

01:53:21.708 --> 01:53:23.000
He's taken the beating and come.

01:53:23.750 --> 01:53:24.666
Who is it?

01:53:24.875 --> 01:53:25.875
Where is he now?

01:53:29.333 --> 01:53:30.250
Tell me…

01:53:31.958 --> 01:53:33.125
No, let's leave it.

01:53:33.958 --> 01:53:34.875
Leave it and?

01:53:35.708 --> 01:53:36.875
Get beaten like this?

01:53:38.416 --> 01:53:39.291
Don't we need to give it back?

01:53:41.833 --> 01:53:42.833
Thirunavukarasu,

01:53:43.125 --> 01:53:44.166
where is he now?

01:53:44.708 --> 01:53:45.750
Tell me.

01:53:51.708 --> 01:53:52.625
Sabari…

01:53:53.250 --> 01:53:54.750
Do you know where your father works?

01:53:58.958 --> 01:53:59.958
Brother…

01:54:03.708 --> 01:54:04.583
I'll also come.

01:54:34.791 --> 01:54:35.791
Who hit you?

01:54:45.041 --> 01:54:46.041
Is it him?

01:54:47.958 --> 01:54:48.916
Is it him?

01:54:51.625 --> 01:54:52.541
You got it , right…

01:54:52.750 --> 01:54:53.625
Now give it back!

01:54:55.958 --> 01:54:56.833
What?

01:55:01.083 --> 01:55:01.958
You're laughing!

01:55:02.041 --> 01:55:03.833
Don't… Don't…

01:55:04.750 --> 01:55:05.791
Thiruna!

01:55:07.833 --> 01:55:08.708
You're laughing…

01:55:09.000 --> 01:55:09.958
You're laughing…

01:55:10.458 --> 01:55:11.500
You're laughing…

01:55:18.541 --> 01:55:19.750
Stop it!

01:55:20.166 --> 01:55:21.083
Stop it!

01:55:21.208 --> 01:55:22.125
Stop it!

01:55:22.250 --> 01:55:23.583
Why are you beating up my laborer?

01:55:23.666 --> 01:55:24.541
Who are you?

01:55:25.166 --> 01:55:27.541
Your laborer has hit one of his coworkers.

01:55:29.000 --> 01:55:30.041
Did you hit him?

01:55:32.708 --> 01:55:34.166
If you ask the man who hit him,
he'll deny it!

01:55:34.250 --> 01:55:35.208
Ask the guy who got hit!

01:55:35.833 --> 01:55:36.750
Look at his face!

01:55:37.958 --> 01:55:39.000
Did he hit you?

01:55:41.833 --> 01:55:42.708
Tell him!

01:55:49.291 --> 01:55:50.166
No, sir.

01:55:53.833 --> 01:55:54.791
What about these wounds?

01:55:57.416 --> 01:55:58.458
I had a fall, sir.

01:56:01.250 --> 01:56:03.375
He's denying it.
Why are you needlessly--

01:56:18.250 --> 01:56:20.416
Get going, all of you.
Get back to work.

01:56:28.666 --> 01:56:29.541
Sabari.

01:56:32.041 --> 01:56:35.000
Go tell Kannima and Thenu that
I've asked them to come downstairs.

01:56:47.708 --> 01:56:48.583
Brother…

01:56:51.625 --> 01:56:52.500
Brother…

01:56:53.125 --> 01:56:54.000
Brother…

01:56:55.125 --> 01:56:56.166
Forgive me.

01:56:57.916 --> 01:56:59.166
If I had said yes,

01:56:59.541 --> 01:57:01.250
the manager would have sacked him.

01:57:02.458 --> 01:57:03.416
He's a family man.

01:57:04.250 --> 01:57:05.375
Due to his mistakes,

01:57:05.458 --> 01:57:07.083
why should his wife and children suffer?

01:57:17.000 --> 01:57:17.916
See you.

01:57:19.083 --> 01:57:20.875
G. SONAIMUTHU COOKER, MIXER,
AND GAS STOVE SERVICE CENTER

01:57:21.791 --> 01:57:22.750
Nothing…

01:57:49.541 --> 01:57:50.500
Who is it?

01:57:53.375 --> 01:57:54.291
Isn't Jyothi here?

01:57:54.583 --> 01:57:55.458
Who?

01:58:04.916 --> 01:58:06.416
Hitting you the other day,
I was wrong.

01:58:07.125 --> 01:58:08.166
Forgive me, Jyothi.

01:58:10.750 --> 01:58:12.208
I behaved very badly,

01:58:12.500 --> 01:58:13.416
forgive me.

01:58:15.791 --> 01:58:17.791
On the coming 18th, I am having my
daughter's puberty function.

01:58:18.708 --> 01:58:19.666
You must come.

01:58:20.125 --> 01:58:21.083
Here.

01:58:38.375 --> 01:58:39.375
Baby.

01:58:55.833 --> 01:58:57.250
Why you coming,
looking so flustered?

01:58:58.541 --> 01:58:59.916
Where did you go early in the morning?

01:59:00.500 --> 01:59:01.583
I woke up and you weren't there.

01:59:04.000 --> 01:59:05.333
I went to Jyothi's house.

01:59:06.000 --> 01:59:06.958
To Jyothi's house?

01:59:07.041 --> 01:59:07.916
Hmmm…

01:59:08.083 --> 01:59:09.750
Why did you go to Jyothi's house
at this hour?

01:59:10.375 --> 01:59:12.000
We've invited all our foes,

01:59:12.083 --> 01:59:13.250
he was the only one left.

01:59:13.583 --> 01:59:15.791
If he wakes up in the morning
and goes out.

01:59:16.291 --> 01:59:18.291
That's why, I went to his house,
apologized to him,

01:59:18.958 --> 01:59:19.916
and invited him.

01:59:21.375 --> 01:59:22.375
You apologized?

01:59:25.541 --> 01:59:26.500
Nothing.

01:59:26.791 --> 01:59:28.250
Yesterday the guy who hit
Thirunavukarasu, right,

01:59:28.333 --> 01:59:29.500
his wife and children weren't there.

01:59:30.375 --> 01:59:31.875
But he was able to think about them.

01:59:33.333 --> 01:59:35.750
The other day when I thrashed
Jyothi at the market,

01:59:36.333 --> 01:59:38.458
His wife fell at my feet and begged.

01:59:39.500 --> 01:59:41.375
His daughter was standing there and
weeping profusely.

01:59:43.708 --> 01:59:45.125
I couldn't care a damn about them.

01:59:49.250 --> 01:59:50.750
I felt like going to Jyothi's house and,

01:59:50.833 --> 01:59:52.708
apologizing to Jyothi's wife and daughter.

01:59:54.000 --> 01:59:55.125
I saw them, apologized,

01:59:55.625 --> 01:59:56.583
and invited them.

02:00:00.541 --> 02:00:01.500
What did they say?

02:00:03.875 --> 02:00:05.250
Will know only if they come
for the function.

02:00:12.458 --> 02:00:14.208
For a few days you please don't go
anywhere alone.

02:00:15.583 --> 02:00:16.583
I'll come with you,

02:00:17.375 --> 02:00:18.875
or at least take Delhi or Durai.

02:00:28.583 --> 02:00:29.458
Brother,

02:00:29.916 --> 02:00:31.500
I want to tell you something.

02:00:32.458 --> 02:00:37.541
I was the one who locked
you inside the toilet.

02:01:13.000 --> 02:01:14.458
Why you not treating me?

02:01:14.541 --> 02:01:15.916
We don't serve all that at the function.

02:01:16.000 --> 02:01:16.875
You shouldn't drink.

02:01:16.958 --> 02:01:18.291
Once you are drunk you are unbearable.

02:01:18.416 --> 02:01:19.916
Then we cannot control you.

02:01:20.166 --> 02:01:21.625
Come… come…

02:01:23.083 --> 02:01:23.958
brother.

02:01:24.333 --> 02:01:25.541
-Come, brother
-Come, Sabari.

02:01:25.750 --> 02:01:27.000
-Here.
-Sabari,

02:01:27.416 --> 02:01:28.541
you've come alone…

02:01:29.458 --> 02:01:30.458
What do you want?

02:01:31.125 --> 02:01:32.000
This…

02:01:32.541 --> 02:01:34.375
-Enough… enough…
-Go, eat.

02:01:35.291 --> 02:01:36.208
Go sit and eat.

02:01:44.750 --> 02:01:45.625
Thenu…

02:01:45.875 --> 02:01:46.791
Coming…

02:01:55.625 --> 02:01:56.583
Uncle,

02:01:56.666 --> 02:01:58.125
there will be people thronging the stage.

02:01:58.250 --> 02:01:59.458
It should be really strong okay?

02:01:59.666 --> 02:02:00.583
Hey! Uncle!

02:02:07.583 --> 02:02:08.750
-Brother.
-What is it ?

02:02:09.041 --> 02:02:09.916
Brother,

02:02:10.000 --> 02:02:11.000
Selvam's out?

02:02:12.083 --> 02:02:12.958
Okay.

02:02:13.041 --> 02:02:14.125
Hold this.

02:02:14.416 --> 02:02:15.625
-Annamalai…
-Brother.

02:02:16.583 --> 02:02:17.458
Here…

02:02:19.416 --> 02:02:20.625
The petromax light here is not working.

02:02:21.833 --> 02:02:23.000
Go check and come.

02:02:28.166 --> 02:02:29.041
Kannima,

02:02:29.125 --> 02:02:30.500
Selvam's come out of jail only yesterday.

02:02:30.625 --> 02:02:32.083
Let me go and invite him.

02:02:33.708 --> 02:02:34.791
Okay, don't go alone.

02:02:34.916 --> 02:02:35.875
Take Delhi with you.

02:02:43.125 --> 02:02:44.666
-Brother? Where to?
-What?

02:02:45.458 --> 02:02:46.583
Just nearby.

02:02:47.583 --> 02:02:48.750
Shall we also come?

02:02:49.416 --> 02:02:50.333
Don't want.

02:02:50.541 --> 02:02:51.458
I'll go and come.

02:02:51.875 --> 02:02:52.833
Okay.

02:02:52.958 --> 02:02:55.666
THENMOAZHI

02:02:55.791 --> 02:02:57.791
Shall I also come?

02:02:58.958 --> 02:02:59.958
Come.

02:03:00.750 --> 02:03:01.625
Hey!

02:03:07.333 --> 02:03:08.291
Shall we go?

02:03:09.250 --> 02:03:10.125
I'll be back.

02:03:31.958 --> 02:03:32.958
Brother,

02:03:33.291 --> 02:03:34.166
Come.

02:03:34.625 --> 02:03:36.125
-Give me betel leaves for 50 paise,
-Okay.

02:03:36.375 --> 02:03:38.125
-and fruits for one and a half rupees.
-Okay.

02:03:38.375 --> 02:03:39.250
Sabari,

02:03:39.458 --> 02:03:40.416
why you standing here?

02:03:41.958 --> 02:03:42.958
Will you eat ‘Murukku'?

02:03:45.458 --> 02:03:46.500
You don't want?

02:03:46.875 --> 02:03:47.833
Anything else?

02:03:48.333 --> 02:03:49.291
You don't want anything?

02:03:49.750 --> 02:03:50.625
Why?

02:03:58.708 --> 02:03:59.958
Why you looking troubled, Sabari?

02:04:00.625 --> 02:04:01.500
Nothing…

02:04:01.791 --> 02:04:02.708
Nothing?

02:04:09.708 --> 02:04:10.583
Hey Kid…

02:04:11.125 --> 02:04:12.083
Hey Kid…

02:04:14.166 --> 02:04:15.291
He is?

02:04:15.833 --> 02:04:16.833
My boy only…

02:04:17.250 --> 02:04:18.166
Why?

02:04:21.708 --> 02:04:23.125
Even he used to come and
buy rusk everyday.

02:04:23.916 --> 02:04:25.583
Assuming it's this kid,

02:04:25.750 --> 02:04:28.625
Delhi and me have been unnecessarily,
searching all over the area.

02:04:35.500 --> 02:04:36.875
Kid, shall I pack some rusk?

02:06:24.083 --> 02:06:25.583
You like rusk a lot, is it?

02:06:29.708 --> 02:06:30.750
Even I like it a lot.

02:06:31.833 --> 02:06:33.166
When I was young,
I was like you.

02:06:41.791 --> 02:06:43.750
The guy who locked me up
inside the bathroom,

02:06:44.375 --> 02:06:46.500
gave me only rusk for 8 days.

02:06:50.083 --> 02:06:51.500
On seeing the rusk at the tea shop,

02:06:51.583 --> 02:06:52.541
those memories came back,

02:06:53.208 --> 02:06:54.625
and my head started spinning.

02:06:57.708 --> 02:06:59.958
Hereafter in my life,
not just never eating rusk,

02:07:00.708 --> 02:07:02.083
I can't even look at it,
that's what he's done.

02:07:04.791 --> 02:07:07.500
Till the very end, who is he?
Why did he do it?

02:07:07.583 --> 02:07:08.958
What did he do it for? I guess we may
never get to know.

02:07:11.500 --> 02:07:13.583
I am completely confused
thinking about it, Sabari.

02:07:26.791 --> 02:07:29.375
Tender Ice-apple will be very tasty.

02:07:31.000 --> 02:07:31.916
Open your mouth.

02:07:40.958 --> 02:07:41.875
What happened?

02:07:44.791 --> 02:07:46.000
Why you crying,
Sabari?

02:07:46.583 --> 02:07:47.458
Huh?

02:07:47.625 --> 02:07:48.625
What happened?

02:07:50.208 --> 02:07:51.208
Oh no!

02:07:52.208 --> 02:07:53.833
Told you my story and made you cry.

02:07:56.125 --> 02:07:57.333
It's nothing,

02:07:57.750 --> 02:07:58.708
don't cry.

02:07:59.791 --> 02:08:00.875
I am fine, isn't it?

02:08:02.208 --> 02:08:03.083
Brother…

02:08:03.833 --> 02:08:06.208
I didn't purposely keep rusk.

02:08:06.833 --> 02:08:09.291
I had money only to buy that.

02:08:11.791 --> 02:08:15.041
The one who locked you inside
the school toilet,

02:08:15.291 --> 02:08:16.875
was… was me.

02:08:20.458 --> 02:08:22.541
I told you,

02:08:22.833 --> 02:08:24.083
when I went to take the toy,

02:08:24.500 --> 02:08:27.583
I… I… opened the toilet door…

02:08:28.041 --> 02:08:30.666
I told you, that you were lying in the
water tank, right…

02:08:32.416 --> 02:08:33.625
That's a lie.

02:08:39.708 --> 02:08:41.625
I said that in fear.

02:08:42.208 --> 02:08:44.250
At school after I took the toy,

02:08:44.333 --> 02:08:46.833
and after I finished going to the toilet,

02:08:46.916 --> 02:08:51.208
I went to check if all the
doors were locked.

02:08:51.458 --> 02:08:55.958
I went to check if the toilet
door was locked.

02:08:56.083 --> 02:08:58.666
It wasn't locked.

02:08:59.125 --> 02:09:01.333
I locked it and I was just leaving.

02:09:01.541 --> 02:09:03.541
You knocked at the door.

02:09:03.916 --> 02:09:05.583
I came to open it…

02:09:05.750 --> 02:09:07.166
But you said…

02:09:07.458 --> 02:09:10.166
Hey! I am Baththa!

02:09:10.333 --> 02:09:11.625
Open the door!

02:09:11.791 --> 02:09:12.791
If you don't open the door,

02:09:12.875 --> 02:09:14.833
I will kill you!

02:09:14.916 --> 02:09:17.208
I heard that and got scared!

02:09:18.541 --> 02:09:19.500
The other day,

02:09:19.583 --> 02:09:22.833
when you were seated at the tea shop,

02:09:23.375 --> 02:09:25.416
I was flying a kite on the terrace.

02:09:26.250 --> 02:09:28.666
By mistake my hand slipped
and hit a stone,

02:09:28.750 --> 02:09:30.333
that fell on you.

02:09:30.458 --> 02:09:32.708
I was like what happened and looked down.

02:09:32.833 --> 02:09:34.375
You looked at me and said,

02:09:34.541 --> 02:09:36.500
Come down,
I'll kill you

02:09:36.583 --> 02:09:37.458
You said that.

02:09:37.541 --> 02:09:41.583
That's why,
I didn't open the door.

02:09:41.666 --> 02:09:43.166
If I had opened the door,

02:09:43.250 --> 02:09:48.375
I was scared you would kill me,
my father and mother…

02:09:50.541 --> 02:09:52.625
The police came and questioned.

02:09:53.166 --> 02:09:56.750
I got even more scared.

02:09:56.958 --> 02:09:59.791
That's why… that's why…
I didn't tell anyone.

02:10:00.041 --> 02:10:02.625
You shouldn't be without eating,

02:10:02.708 --> 02:10:05.750
so everyday I bought rusk from that
uncle's shop,

02:10:05.833 --> 02:10:06.750
and gave it to you.

02:10:08.041 --> 02:10:10.708
One day my mother said we have to leave,

02:10:10.791 --> 02:10:13.083
to our native for the festival.

02:10:13.416 --> 02:10:19.000
If I go to my native,
who will keep food for you…

02:10:19.875 --> 02:10:26.750
So somehow I gathered the courage,

02:10:26.833 --> 02:10:29.833
I opened the door and went in,

02:10:29.916 --> 02:10:32.125
you were lying in the water tank.

02:10:35.916 --> 02:10:37.958
I thought you had died.

02:10:39.166 --> 02:10:43.916
I ran outside and told one person…

02:10:44.291 --> 02:10:48.333
After I came to know you had survived,

02:10:49.208 --> 02:10:52.875
I was so happy.

02:10:53.416 --> 02:10:55.916
I thought of telling you,

02:10:56.541 --> 02:11:01.625
but I was scared you would kill me.

02:11:01.916 --> 02:11:04.458
After I started spending time with you,

02:11:04.541 --> 02:11:05.916
only I came to know,

02:11:06.208 --> 02:11:08.083
that you're not like that.

02:11:08.416 --> 02:11:12.625
You, Kannima aunty and Thenmozhi sister,

02:11:12.708 --> 02:11:19.416
were so affectionate towards me…

02:12:02.375 --> 02:12:03.416
Don't get scared.

02:12:05.166 --> 02:12:06.125
Go back.

02:12:42.333 --> 02:12:44.333
You hit me in front of everyone,

02:12:44.958 --> 02:12:46.416
and then you come home and invite me.

02:12:46.958 --> 02:12:47.875
Will I spare you!

02:12:48.083 --> 02:12:49.000
Die.

02:12:49.208 --> 02:12:50.166
Brother!

02:12:51.125 --> 02:12:52.041
Hold him!

02:12:53.166 --> 02:12:54.208
Brother!

02:12:54.375 --> 02:12:55.458
Sabari

02:12:55.625 --> 02:12:56.500
Sabari… go…

02:12:56.583 --> 02:12:57.458
Sabari…

02:12:57.541 --> 02:12:59.125
-Sabari… go…
-Throw him there.

02:12:59.250 --> 02:13:01.416
-Brother!
-Hey!

02:13:01.791 --> 02:13:02.916
Sabari… go…

02:13:03.250 --> 02:13:04.250
Hey! carry him.

02:13:06.333 --> 02:13:07.375
Brother!

02:13:08.250 --> 02:13:09.250
Go, Sabari!

02:13:09.791 --> 02:13:10.791
Come!

02:14:11.833 --> 02:14:12.916
Kill him!

02:14:13.125 --> 02:14:14.541
I'll take the blame.

02:14:16.333 --> 02:14:17.916
Why you hesitating?
Kill him!

02:14:41.041 --> 02:14:41.958
Come.

02:14:43.166 --> 02:14:44.166
What happened?

02:14:44.750 --> 02:14:46.291
Everyone's sleeping,
let's go inside and talk.

02:14:49.083 --> 02:14:50.375
Sabari?
Sabari, is it?

02:14:50.458 --> 02:14:51.583
Durai has gone to drop Sabari home.

02:14:52.375 --> 02:14:53.375
What happened?

02:14:53.541 --> 02:14:54.541
Jyothi!

02:14:55.041 --> 02:14:57.041
You just see what happens to him.

02:14:57.416 --> 02:14:59.500
He's the one who locked him
in the school toilet.

02:14:59.625 --> 02:15:00.583
It's not him.

02:15:02.500 --> 02:15:03.458
How you saying that?

02:15:03.791 --> 02:15:04.791
Then who?

02:15:06.208 --> 02:15:07.458
I know it's not him.

02:15:07.875 --> 02:15:09.083
You don't know who did it,

02:15:09.166 --> 02:15:10.375
but you know it's not him.

02:15:10.708 --> 02:15:11.625
How's that?

02:15:13.500 --> 02:15:15.166
You're hiding something from me.

02:15:15.750 --> 02:15:16.833
You have spared the guy,

02:15:16.916 --> 02:15:18.125
who came with henchmen to kill you.

02:15:18.416 --> 02:15:19.375
What's happening?

02:15:20.583 --> 02:15:22.416
Why you went to school, that day,
at that time,

02:15:22.500 --> 02:15:23.541
You're not telling us!

02:15:25.791 --> 02:15:26.875
You're not right…

02:15:28.083 --> 02:15:29.208
What do you mean not right?

02:15:29.791 --> 02:15:31.041
You're not like before.

02:15:31.333 --> 02:15:32.333
You've changed.

02:15:32.791 --> 02:15:34.041
You're asking us to not open the shop.

02:15:34.333 --> 02:15:35.625
You're inviting all unnecessary people.

02:15:35.750 --> 02:15:38.416
If you were the same as before, will
Jyothi have the guts?

02:15:39.458 --> 02:15:41.416
The fear of you in the area has gone.

02:15:43.000 --> 02:15:44.000
You're not alright.

02:15:44.083 --> 02:15:44.958
What is not right?

02:15:45.041 --> 02:15:46.375
Hey! Kannima.

02:15:46.583 --> 02:15:47.458
Leave it.

02:15:47.541 --> 02:15:49.208
You want to go indulge
in rowdyism like before,

02:15:49.291 --> 02:15:50.500
and get drunk and roam around, isn't it?

02:15:50.583 --> 02:15:51.583
No, sister!

02:15:51.666 --> 02:15:53.375
In all these years,
only now he's alright.

02:15:54.666 --> 02:15:56.250
Go…
Now you want to…

02:15:56.333 --> 02:15:58.166
Sister, I never said that.

02:15:58.250 --> 02:16:00.083
Hey! Even she's not saying that.

02:16:00.666 --> 02:16:01.583
Come…

02:16:05.708 --> 02:16:07.083
I didn't mean to say that…

02:16:07.958 --> 02:16:09.250
Don't you know her…

02:16:09.916 --> 02:16:10.916
Don't cry.

02:16:12.875 --> 02:16:14.375
Look at me,

02:16:15.458 --> 02:16:16.500
I hit him,

02:16:16.583 --> 02:16:17.500
he hit me.

02:16:17.708 --> 02:16:18.875
-Okay.
-The problem is over.

02:16:19.291 --> 02:16:20.708
Let's not make this bigger.

02:16:21.125 --> 02:16:22.041
What?

02:16:22.250 --> 02:16:23.125
Okay.

02:16:25.625 --> 02:16:27.291
Let's do the work for the
function happily.

02:16:28.625 --> 02:16:29.583
Okay.

02:16:30.958 --> 02:16:32.208
-Go
-Okay, I am leaving, sister.

02:16:47.541 --> 02:16:49.583
I told you not to go alone.

02:16:50.833 --> 02:16:51.791
Don't be scared.

02:16:54.291 --> 02:16:56.666
I know who locked me up in the toilet.

02:16:57.333 --> 02:16:58.208
Who?

02:17:01.125 --> 02:17:02.000
Sabari.

02:17:03.375 --> 02:17:04.333
Sabari?

02:17:04.958 --> 02:17:05.833
Which Sabari?

02:17:09.333 --> 02:17:10.416
Our sabari?

02:17:12.333 --> 02:17:13.333
Lift me.

02:17:21.833 --> 02:17:22.875
That small kid,

02:17:25.000 --> 02:17:27.500
has been suffering all these days.

02:17:31.833 --> 02:17:34.000
I have been such a disgusting person.

02:17:39.875 --> 02:17:40.791
I can't understand.

02:17:53.833 --> 02:17:54.791
Sabari.

02:18:09.666 --> 02:18:10.541
Give.

02:18:12.666 --> 02:18:13.583
Sit.

02:18:17.875 --> 02:18:19.333
You went to school to take this?

02:18:21.125 --> 02:18:22.916
Why did you go there?

02:18:24.333 --> 02:18:25.250
Shall I tell you?

02:18:27.208 --> 02:18:30.583
My first memory is of me singing
to my mother.

02:18:31.958 --> 02:18:33.458
I would've been 2 or 3 years then.

02:18:34.750 --> 02:18:36.208
She used to love my singing.

02:18:37.125 --> 02:18:39.708
When I finished singing she
will hug and kiss me.

02:18:41.875 --> 02:18:43.958
She contracted a disease and
died very early.

02:18:45.333 --> 02:18:47.750
After that whenever I heard a song, I
thought of my mother.

02:18:48.875 --> 02:18:50.458
I used to sing along with it.

02:18:51.500 --> 02:18:53.500
My father used to be drunk
and fallen somewhere.

02:18:53.958 --> 02:18:55.250
My only companion were the songs.

02:18:55.750 --> 02:18:57.583
I used to keep singing.

02:18:58.125 --> 02:18:59.833
“ When the whole town is asleep”

02:19:00.000 --> 02:19:03.333
“ My night is awake ”

02:19:03.708 --> 02:19:07.125
“ When the whole world laughs ”

02:19:07.291 --> 02:19:10.333
“ The moon that weeps

02:19:10.458 --> 02:19:11.625
DEIVATHIN DEIVAM

02:19:11.833 --> 02:19:12.958
If I get any money,

02:19:13.041 --> 02:19:14.666
I will immediately go and buy
a lyric book.

02:19:15.750 --> 02:19:17.083
When I was in the 8th…

02:19:17.166 --> 02:19:20.833
The garden on the banks of the Ganges

02:19:21.375 --> 02:19:26.291
Virgin women flock

02:19:27.041 --> 02:19:31.416
Lord Kannan in the midst.

02:19:31.833 --> 02:19:34.041
o!… o!… o!

02:19:34.125 --> 02:19:35.541
I liked Jayanthi a lot.

02:19:36.333 --> 02:19:39.916
That day when Jayanthi sang that song…

02:19:40.000 --> 02:19:42.041
You fell in love is it?

02:19:42.666 --> 02:19:43.583
Hey…

02:19:43.791 --> 02:19:44.708
Sabari…

02:19:47.500 --> 02:19:48.541
Who is singing next?

02:19:59.708 --> 02:20:03.541
Floating clouds…

02:20:03.625 --> 02:20:06.500
Listen to one word

02:20:07.291 --> 02:20:11.333
To my restless soul

02:20:11.416 --> 02:20:14.875
You offer the comfort

02:20:14.958 --> 02:20:18.958
The vibrant peacock rules

02:20:19.083 --> 02:20:23.666
In that Epic I am King

02:20:25.083 --> 02:20:25.958
Enough, go…

02:20:39.875 --> 02:20:41.250
My heart broke.

02:20:41.625 --> 02:20:42.541
After that,

02:20:42.625 --> 02:20:44.166
I did not have the courage to sing in
front of anyone.

02:20:45.666 --> 02:20:47.250
Why that teacher,
stopped me half way,

02:20:47.333 --> 02:20:48.541
I understood only later.

02:20:50.125 --> 02:20:52.583
At that young age,
if someone sings a love song,

02:20:52.833 --> 02:20:55.625
with so much intensity,
which teacher won't stop it.

02:20:57.041 --> 02:20:58.625
I selected the wrong song.

02:20:59.375 --> 02:21:01.416
Once I understood that,
I got interested again.

02:21:01.541 --> 02:21:02.916
Any song I listen to,

02:21:03.000 --> 02:21:06.333
I will imagine myself holding a mike, and
singing that song,

02:21:06.666 --> 02:21:08.041
When I was in the 10th standard,

02:21:08.583 --> 02:21:10.791
at our ‘Amman' Temple, for the first
time, they organized a music concert.

02:21:11.625 --> 02:21:13.291
A few people from the area,

02:21:13.375 --> 02:21:14.958
went and asked and sang a song on stage.

02:21:15.750 --> 02:21:18.666
Even I wanted to go on stage and hold the
mike and sing.

02:21:19.250 --> 02:21:21.375
Hesitatingly I went and finally asked,

02:21:21.625 --> 02:21:22.708
and sang on the stage.

02:21:23.791 --> 02:21:30.708
A new sky…

02:21:31.208 --> 02:21:38.125
A new land…

02:21:40.708 --> 02:21:41.958
A new sky…

02:21:42.041 --> 02:21:43.666
A new land…

02:21:43.750 --> 02:21:46.750
A shower of dew drops glowing
everywhere

02:21:47.250 --> 02:21:48.833
When I come

02:21:48.916 --> 02:21:50.583
To welcome me

02:21:50.666 --> 02:21:55.083
A shower of colorful flowers

02:22:02.708 --> 02:22:04.000
A new sky…

02:22:04.166 --> 02:22:05.708
A new land…

02:22:05.791 --> 02:22:08.583
A shower of dew drops
glowing everywhere

02:22:08.708 --> 02:22:13.250
-Get down.
-Ask him to get down.

02:22:13.458 --> 02:22:14.791
Only that day I realized,

02:22:15.666 --> 02:22:18.125
that the teacher didn't stop me
cause of the song,

02:22:19.166 --> 02:22:21.166
but would have stopped me if
I had sung any song.

02:22:22.458 --> 02:22:24.083
After that in the area everyone,

02:22:24.500 --> 02:22:26.583
A new sky…

02:22:26.666 --> 02:22:28.875
A new land…

02:22:32.291 --> 02:22:37.041
A new sky…

02:22:37.166 --> 02:22:38.333
I went and sang with so much passion,

02:22:38.750 --> 02:22:40.666
They teased me… Shamed me,

02:22:40.750 --> 02:22:42.583
and killed the singer in me.

02:22:42.791 --> 02:22:44.125
At one point I really lost my temper.

02:22:45.791 --> 02:22:47.833
‘See what I do to all of you' kind
of anger.

02:22:48.333 --> 02:22:49.833
The biggest mistake I made,

02:22:50.041 --> 02:22:52.333
consumed by anger I went
and joined a rowdy gang.

02:22:52.666 --> 02:22:55.958
I thrashed everyone who teased me.

02:22:58.208 --> 02:23:00.791
I thought everyone in the area,
should get scared at the sight of me.

02:23:04.125 --> 02:23:05.541
Just like that my life changed.

02:23:08.625 --> 02:23:10.166
I never sang after that.

02:23:12.083 --> 02:23:13.708
After I got married to Kannima,

02:23:13.875 --> 02:23:15.666
I sang only to her.

02:23:16.000 --> 02:23:18.208
Whilst the breeze sleeps

02:23:18.375 --> 02:23:20.708
Whilst the sun sleeps

02:23:21.125 --> 02:23:22.958
Will my eyes sleep

02:23:24.791 --> 02:23:28.000
Will my love laden eyes sleep

02:23:36.083 --> 02:23:36.958
Dear…

02:23:37.958 --> 02:23:38.833
My love…

02:23:39.250 --> 02:23:40.916
Only others should get scared of me.

02:23:44.875 --> 02:23:45.750
No,

02:23:46.333 --> 02:23:48.708
if you don't sing,
I won't get scared.

02:23:54.291 --> 02:23:55.333
Thenu was born.

02:23:55.625 --> 02:23:57.875
Whenever I got time, I only used to sing
and put her to sleep.

02:23:58.541 --> 02:23:59.958
Thenu has grown a little bit.

02:24:00.083 --> 02:24:03.500
-She keeps melting into her baby language…
-Are you crazy or what? Stop singing.

02:24:03.583 --> 02:24:05.791
-It's nothing.
-Don't sing daddy…

02:24:05.958 --> 02:24:07.916
-It's nothing.
-Don't sing daddy…

02:24:08.041 --> 02:24:11.541
-It's nothing.
-Don't sing daddy…

02:24:11.875 --> 02:24:13.166
That was the last time.

02:24:14.500 --> 02:24:16.666
After that,
at home, in the area,

02:24:16.875 --> 02:24:18.500
I couldn't sing anywhere.

02:24:18.666 --> 02:24:21.375
After I fixed the music troupe for Thenu's
function and came,

02:24:22.125 --> 02:24:23.416
M.G.R.'s film was playing on Television,

02:24:24.000 --> 02:24:25.666
I saw a man holding a mike and singing.

02:24:27.750 --> 02:24:30.041
M.G.R. will be looking at him with
a sense of longing.

02:24:32.625 --> 02:24:34.875
My heart yearned to sing again.

02:24:37.333 --> 02:24:38.500
But this time,

02:24:38.708 --> 02:24:40.500
I wanted to practice properly,

02:24:40.583 --> 02:24:43.250
and sing in such a way that
everyone's stunned.

02:24:44.208 --> 02:24:45.375
I was thinking about what do.

02:24:45.625 --> 02:24:47.000
School closed for the holidays.

02:24:47.458 --> 02:24:49.250
I thought I can practice there,

02:24:49.333 --> 02:24:50.750
and slyly went to school.

02:24:51.875 --> 02:24:52.875
I wanted to go to the toilet.

02:24:53.958 --> 02:24:55.875
So I thought let's go and then come.

02:24:57.083 --> 02:24:58.666
You locked the door.

02:24:59.750 --> 02:25:00.625
Okay…

02:25:01.541 --> 02:25:04.416
I realized that God himself
didn't like me to sing.

02:25:09.208 --> 02:25:10.083
Sabari.

02:25:11.083 --> 02:25:13.916
Only Kannima and Thenu,
now you know about this.

02:25:15.458 --> 02:25:17.916
If everyone comes to know, Baththa went
inside the school,

02:25:18.000 --> 02:25:19.375
to sing, and this happened,

02:25:19.750 --> 02:25:21.875
I feared they will mock me in the area.

02:25:23.875 --> 02:25:25.833
I am already very hurt
regarding this issue.

02:25:26.958 --> 02:25:28.541
I won't be able to bear it
anymore, Sabari.

02:25:29.208 --> 02:25:30.083
Understood?

02:25:30.375 --> 02:25:32.833
Yes, don't tell anyone.

02:25:33.083 --> 02:25:35.833
Then when you sing in the evening, it
won't be a surprise.

02:25:36.208 --> 02:25:37.625
Why am I going to sing in the evening…

02:25:37.750 --> 02:25:38.625
Why?

02:25:38.833 --> 02:25:40.333
I haven't practiced.

02:25:40.500 --> 02:25:42.166
You're singing well only…

02:25:42.291 --> 02:25:43.250
When did you hear?

02:25:43.333 --> 02:25:44.833
Just now a little while ago,

02:25:44.916 --> 02:25:46.333
when you were in the 8th standard,

02:25:46.666 --> 02:25:48.583
you sang a song in school, isn't it?

02:25:48.666 --> 02:25:49.916
It was superb.

02:25:50.416 --> 02:25:51.500
Was it good?

02:25:56.000 --> 02:25:57.583
I can sing the stanza even better.

02:25:57.958 --> 02:25:59.500
The teacher stopped me half way.

02:25:59.666 --> 02:26:01.958
Sing in the evening.
Even Kannima aunty and

02:26:02.041 --> 02:26:05.750
Thenmozhi sister, will be thinking you're
not going to sing.

02:26:06.000 --> 02:26:07.750
It will be a surprise for them also.

02:26:10.500 --> 02:26:11.500
So you think I should sing?

02:26:13.833 --> 02:26:15.125
What if they mock me again?

02:26:15.208 --> 02:26:18.000
Don't stop this time, complete it.

02:26:35.250 --> 02:26:36.208
Hello brother.

02:26:36.291 --> 02:26:37.166
-Baththa.
-Please come.

02:26:40.875 --> 02:26:41.875
Welcome sir…
Welcome sir…

02:26:42.333 --> 02:26:43.458
