02:27:37.416 --> 02:27:40.083
Jayanthi, ma'am has come.
Make her sit next to you.

02:27:41.083 --> 02:27:41.958
Come, Mam.

02:27:44.083 --> 02:27:44.958
Hey, Sabari,

02:27:45.041 --> 02:27:46.708
I told you about my teacher,
isn't it. This is her.

02:27:48.333 --> 02:27:49.875
This is Jayanthi.

02:27:51.250 --> 02:27:52.125
What?

02:27:52.208 --> 02:27:53.083
Sit.

02:27:53.666 --> 02:27:59.291
Green parrot, pearl necklace,
